需要先确认PT101点是否存在。可以使用manage_points工具来列出所有点，或者按名称筛选。目前可用的工具有manage_pages和manage_points。manage_points的list_points动作可以列出所有点。让我先调用这个工具来查看现有的点。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1146, "output_tokens": 43, "latency_ms": 3840.744099998119, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "看起来type_filter需要是具体的类型，而不是None。让我省略type_filter参数。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2093, "output_tokens": 255, "latency_ms": 8942.872899999202, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "现在已进入 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段，我将为 PT101 创建高限报警。", "reasoning": "The user wants me to create a high limit alarm for PT101 with threshold 2.0 and medium priority. I'm now in CONFIG_ALARM phase.\n\nI need to use the manage_alarms tool with the create_analog_alarm action. PT101 sounds like a pressure transmitter (analog point), so I should create an analog alarm.\n\nThe parameters I need:\n- action: \"create_analog_alarm\"\n- id: I need to generate an alarm ID, something like \"alarm_pt101_high\"\n- tag: \"PT101\"\n- high_limit: 2.0\n- priority: \"medium\"\n- low_limit: null (not needed)\n- deadband: 0.0 (default)\n\nLet me create this alarm."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 4206, "output_tokens": 427, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 21407.675599999493}, "judge": null}
