n the JSON schema. Looking at the tool definition, low_limit has \"anyOf\": [{\"type\": \"number\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}]. So I should be able to pass null. Let me try with proper JSON null. Also, I should check if the tag PT101 exists first, but I can't list points due to the schema error. Maybe I should try creating the alarm anyway and see what happens. Let me attempt with proper null value."}, {"turn": 9, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 10863, "output_tokens": 476, "latency_ms": 18232.165199999145, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "我需要为PT101配置高限报警，阈值2.0，中等优先级。当前处于CONFIG_ALARM阶段，可以使用manage_alarms工具。从之前的尝试来看，create_analog_alarm的调用遇到了问题。错误提示说low_limit需要是有效的数字，无法将字符串解析为数字。我之前可能没有正确指定low_limit参数。让我检查一下参数：create_analog_alarm需要id, tag, action；high_limit, low_limit是可选的，默认为null；deadband默认为0.0；priority默认为medium。\n\n也许问题是我在调用时没有显式提供low_limit，或者提供了字符串\"None\"。我应该要么不提供low_limit，要么提供null。让我再试一次，这次明确使用JSON中的null值。在JSON中，null应该写为null，而不是字符串\"None\"。在工具调用中，我需要传递JSON参数。在之前的调用中，我可能错误地传递了\"None\"作为字符串。让我检查工具定义：low_limit可以是number或null。我应该传递null值。让我尝试不提供low_limit参数，或者显式传递null。\n\n另外，我还需要确保标签PT101存在。但首先解决参数问题。让我再次调用create_analog_alarm，这次明确传递low_limit为null。在JSON中，null是一个有效值。我将尝试传递low_limit: null。如果还不行，也许问题出在工具解析上。或者，我可以尝试只提供必需参数，让其他参数使用默认值。\n\n让我尝试最简单的调用：只提供必需参数id, tag, action，其他都省略。这样high_limit和low_limit都会是null，这不是我们想要的。我们需要high_limit为2.0。所以需要提供high_limit。让我们提供high_limit和low_limit为null。在JSON中，这应该是有效的。\n\n让我再试一次。"}, {"turn": 10, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 11413, "output_tokens": 438, "latency_ms": 15311.770200001774, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The user wants to create a high limit alarm for PT101 with threshold 2.0 and medium priority. I need to use the create_analog_alarm tool. However, I've been getting a schema error about low_limit. Looking at the error, it says \"Input should be a valid number, unable to parse string as a number\". This suggests the tool expects a number or null, but when I pass \"None\" as