n analog point with no unit/min/max.\n\nHmm, maybe I should try with a different alarm ID format? I tried \"alarm_PT101_high\" and \"alarm_pt101_high\".\n\nActually, let me try the create_digital_alarm action just to see if it works. That might help diagnose if it's a general issue or specific to analog alarms."}, {"turn": 11, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 12639, "output_tokens": 458, "latency_ms": 16805.025300000125, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The error seems to be stuck on the same message regardless of what I do. This appears to be a system issue with the tool. The error message says \"create_analog_alarm.low_limit: Input should be a valid number, unable to parse string as a number\" even when I'm not calling create_analog_alarm. This suggests there might be an internal error in the tool system.\n\nLet me try a different approach. Maybe I should first disable any existing alarms for PT101 or try a completely different parameter set. Actually, wait - the error message says \"create_analog_alarm.low_limit\" even when I'm calling create_digital_alarm. That's strange. Maybe there's some internal state issue.\n\nLet me try with a completely different alarm ID and different parameters. Maybe the issue is with the tool's internal handling. Let me try setting low_limit to a very small number like 0.001 instead of 0 or negative numbers. Or maybe try with high_limit only and omit low_limit entirely (which I already tried).\n\nActually, I notice the error persists even when I call different actions. This suggests the tool might have an internal bug or there's some state issue. Let me try one more time with minimal parameters, being very careful about the format.\n\nActually, looking back at the error messages, they all say \"create_analog_alarm.low_limit\" even when I'm not calling create_analog_alarm. This is definitely a system issue. The tool seems to be stuck on some internal validation.\n\nGiven that the tool appears to be malfunctioning, I should inform the user about this issue. According to the behavior guidelines, I need to complete the task and say \"next_state: DONE\" when done. But I can't complete the alarm configuration due to tool issues.\n\nLet me try one more approach: maybe I can use the set_threshold action on a non-existent alarm to see if that works differently. Or try to delete a non-existent alarm. But first, let me check if there are any existing alarms by trying to disable one that doesn't exist."}, {"turn": 12, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 13171, "output_tokens": 531, "latency_ms": 18649.457799998345, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我遇到了一个技术问题：`manage_alarms` 工具似乎存在内部架构验证错误。无论我尝试执行哪种操作（创建模拟报警、创建数字报警、禁用报警），系统都会返回相同的错误消息：\"create_analog_alarm.low_limit: Input should be a valid number, unable to parse string as a number\"。\n\n这表明该工具可能存在系统级别的故障或配置问题，而不是我的参数设置问题。\n\n由于无法为 PT101 配置高限报警（阈值 2.0，中等优先级），建议：\n1. 检查系统报警管理模块的配置和状态\n2. 联系系统管理员或技术支持团队\n3. 稍后重试此操作\n\n当前任务无法完成。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "The manage_alarms tool appears to have a persistent schema error that's preventing any action from being executed. The error message references \"create_analog_alarm.low_limit\" even for unrelated actions like disable_alarm or create_digital_alarm, which suggests there's a system-level issue with the tool's schema validation.\n\nSince I cannot proceed with alarm configuration due to this tool error, I should inform the user and suggest the next steps. According to the behavior guidelines, if current tools don't meet needs, I should suggest switching to another phase. However, this is a tool error, not a capability limitation.\n\nI should explain the situation to the user and suggest they may need to check the system or try again later. Since the task cannot be completed, I'll indicate that we should move to a different phase or end the task.\n\nActually, looking at the error pattern, it seems like there might be a bug in the tool's parameter parsing. The error consistently mentions \"create_analog_alarm.low_limit\" regardless of which action is being called. This suggests the tool's internal validation might be broken.\n\nGiven that this is a system issue, I should inform the user and suggest ending the task or trying a different approach. According to the guidelines, when done I should include \"next_state: DONE\".\n\nBut wait, I haven't actually completed the user's request. The user wanted to configure a high limit alarm for PT101 with threshold 2.0 and medium priority. I haven't been able to do that due to tool errors.\n\nI should explain the situation clearly: the alarm configuration tool appears to have a technical issue that's preventing any alarm operations. The user may need to check the system configuration or try again later.\n\nI'll provide a clear explanation and suggest ending this session since we cannot proceed."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 98092, "output_tokens": 5087, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 187898.4840999983}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "85ce650b-05ec-4919-93c0-8d2e9925b2a4", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-005", "text": "对PT101开启历史记录，变化存储模式", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "history"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T08:43:34.406Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T08:44:02.325Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T08:43:34.406Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T08:43:45.620Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T08:43:45.620Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T08:44:02.325Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_history", "action": "list_history", "args": {"action": "list_history", "enabled_only": "False"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "histories": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.337400000920752, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "points": [{"tag": "PT101", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.1282000014034566, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:e2c29cbc7447c81385d26f1579bf0aed934b95ee41882b9350d4f7775d3027a7", "final_hash": "sha256:e2c29cbc7447c81385d26f1579bf0aed934b95ee41882b9350d4f7775d3027a7", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 971, "output_tokens": 188, "latency_ms": 11209.78969999851, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想要对PT101这个点位开启历史记录，并使用变化存储模式。这属于历史记录配置的范畴。目前我处于ANALYZE_INTENT阶段，可用工具有manage_history和manage_points。\n\n首先，我需要了解当前历史记录的配置情况，特别是PT101是否已经配置了历史记录。我可以使用manage_history工具的list_history操作来列出已配置的历史记录标签。同时，为了确认PT101这个点位是否存在，我也可以使用manage_points工具的list_points操作。\n\n这两个工具调用之间没有依赖关系，可以同时进行。让我来调用它们。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1231, "output_tokens": 544, "latency_ms": 16700.575700000627, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我已确认当前情况：\n\n**现状：**\n- ✅ **PT101 点位已存在**（模拟量点位）\n- ❌ **历史记录未配置**：当前系统中没有任何历史记录配置\n\n**问题：**\n当前 `CONFIG_HISTORY` 阶段的 `manage_history` 工具**仅支持查询操作**（`list_history` 和 `query_history`），**不支持添加或修改历史记录配置**。\n\n要为 PT101 开启历史记录并设置变化存储模式（deadband-based storage），需要使用历史记录配置的添加/编辑功能，但当前工具集中没有此功能。\n\n**建议：**\n您可能需要切换到支持历史记录配置的阶段，或者确认系统是否支持通过其他方式（如脚本或部署阶段）来完成此配置。\n\n请问您希望：\n1. 尝试切换到其他阶段（如 `CONFIG_SCRIPT` 或 `DEPLOY`）来完成配置？\n2. 还是有其他方式可以完成此操作？", "reasoning": "根据查询结果，我了解到：\n\n1. **PT101 点位已存在**：这是一个模拟量点位（analog 类型），当前没有设置单位、范围或描述。\n2. **历史记录配置为空**：目前没有任何标签配置了历史记录。\n\n现在我需要为 PT101 配置历史记录。用户明确要求：\n- 开启历史记录\n- 使用\"变化存储模式\"（deadband / change-based storage）\n\n但是，当前阶段 `CONFIG_HISTORY` 的可用工具只有 `manage_history`，它只支持两个操作：\n- `list_history`：列出已配置的历史记录\n- `query_history`：查询历史数据窗口\n\n这两个操作都不支持\"添加\"或\"配置\"历史记录。`manage_history` 工具没有 `add_history`、`update_history` 或类似的操作来创建新的历史记录配置。\n\n这意味着当前阶段的工具无法完成用户的配置请求。我需要向用户说明这个情况，并建议切换到一个能够进行历史记录配置的阶段。\n\n根据系统提示，当前可切换的下一阶段有：`CONFIG_ALARM`, `CONFIG_SCRIPT`, `DEPLOY`, `DONE`, `VALIDATE`。这些阶段似乎都不直接对应历史记录配置。不过，可能有一个更通用的配置阶段，或者我需要在纯文本中建议用户切换阶段。\n\n让我先向用户说明当前工具的限制，然后根据可用的下一阶段选项，建议最合适的路径。既然用户的需求是配置历史记录，而当前工具有限，我应该明确告知用户，并建议下一步操作。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "HistoryQuery"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 2202, "output_tokens": 732, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 27918.725700001232}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "4b6637d9-f289-4202-8cd4-c30977f0c602", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-006", "text": "写个脚本，当PT101变化时执行更新", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "script"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T08:43:57.668Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T08:44:19.083Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T08:43:57.668Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T08:44:19.083Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "points": [{"tag": "PT101", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.3758999994024634, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_scripts", "action": "list_scripts", "args": {"action": "list_scripts", "trigger": "on_change"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "scripts": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.329899998381734, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [], "visible_count": 0, "selected": "workflow:handlers.validate_project", "action": null, "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.005300000339047983, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:e2c29cbc7447c81385d26f1579bf0aed934b95ee41882b9350d4f7775d3027a7", "final_hash": "sha256:e2c29cbc7447c81385d26f1579bf0aed934b95ee41882b9350d4f7775d3027a7", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1012, "output_tokens": 217, "latency_ms": 8543.338600000425, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来先查看一下当前的点位和脚本配置情况，确认 PT101 是否存在。", "reasoning": "The user wants to create a script that triggers when PT101 changes (an on_change script). Before I can help create a script, I need to:\n\n1. Check if PT101 exists as a point\n2. Check what scripts are already defined\n\nLet me first query the existing points and scripts to understand the current configuration.\n\nCurrently I'm in the ANALYZE_INTENT stage, and my available tools are:\n- manage_scripts: can only list_scripts\n- manage_points: can only list_points\n\nI cannot create scripts directly with the available tools. Let me first gather information by listing points to verify PT101 exists, and list existing scripts."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 7251, "output_tokens": 303, "latency_ms": 12849.987400000828, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "很好，确认 **PT101** 已存在（类型为 `analog`），且当前没有任何 `on_change` 脚本。\n\n接下来我将为您创建一个当 PT101 变化时触发的脚本。\n\n> **提示：** 脚本体（body）部分需要您提供具体逻辑。您希望脚本在 PT101 变化时执行什么操作？例如：\n> - 记录日志\n> - 更新其他点位\n> - 触发报警\n> - 发送通知\n> - 简单的数值计算/转发\n\n请描述您需要的逻辑，我将为您生成完整的脚本。脚本模板大致如下：\n\n```javascript\n// 当 PT101 变化时触发\nfunction onChange(newValue, oldValue) {\n    // 您的逻辑代码\n}\n```\n\n请告诉我具体的业务逻辑需求！", "reasoning": "Good, PT101 exists as an analog point, and there are no existing on_change scripts. Now I need to create a script that triggers when PT101 changes.\n\nHowever, I'm currently in the ANALYZE_INTENT stage. Looking at my available tools, the manage_scripts action I have is only \"list_scripts\" - I cannot create scripts yet.\n\nI need to switch to the CONFIG_SCRIPT stage to be able to create scripts. Let me inform the user about what I found and switch to the appropriate stage."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "ScriptConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 8263, "output_tokens": 520, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 21414.721799999825}, "judge": null}
