easoning": "Good, I can see:\n\n1. **Point PT101** exists - it's an analog type point, but doesn't have unit, min, max, or description configured yet.\n2. No on_change scripts exist yet.\n\nThe user wants to create an on_change script that fires when PT101 changes. I need to ask the user what the script should actually do when PT101 changes - what's the update logic? The user said \"当PT101变化时执行更新\" which means \"execute update when PT101 changes\" but they haven't specified what exactly should be updated or what the script body should contain.\n\nLet me ask the user what the script body should be - what should happen when PT101 changes?"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "ScriptConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 8253, "output_tokens": 596, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 20932.24110000301}, "judge": null}
