执行更新\" (execute update) - this is a bit vague. I'll create a script with a basic body that does something reasonable like logging the change, and let the user know they can update the body later."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 7525, "output_tokens": 198, "latency_ms": 7755.478899998707, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "脚本已成功创建！以下是配置详情：\n\n| 配置项 | 值 |\n|--------|-----|\n| **脚本 ID** | `on_change_PT101` |\n| **脚本名称** | PT101变化触发脚本 |\n| **触发类型** | `on_change`（值变化时触发） |\n| **绑定点位** | `PT101` |\n| **当前状态** | 已启用 |\n\n**脚本逻辑：**\n- 当 PT101 的值发生变化时，自动触发脚本执行\n- 获取 PT101 的当前值并记录日志\n\n> 📝 当前脚本体为模板代码。如果您需要执行具体的业务逻辑（如联动控制、数据写入、报警判断等），请告诉我，我可以帮您更新脚本内容。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "The script was created successfully. Let me summarize for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "ScriptConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 15690, "output_tokens": 652, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 24614.73020000267}, "judge": null}
