", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "histories": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.5432000000146218, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 989, "output_tokens": 427, "latency_ms": 15066.20760000078, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我需要为您创建三个AI点位（TI-201、PI-201、FI-201）并配置历史记录。当前阶段可用的工具不支持创建点位，我需要切换到点位配置阶段。\n\n接下来我将切换到点位配置阶段来帮您添加这些点位。在创建之前，您能提供一下这些点位的具体配置信息吗？比如：\n- 每个点位的描述（例如：TI-201是温度点）\n- 工程单位（如℃、kPa、m³/h等）\n- 量程范围（量程下限和上限）\n- 是否有其他特殊配置需求\n\n如果这些信息暂时没有，我可以先用默认值创建，之后再调整。\n\nnext_state: CONFIG_POINT", "reasoning": "用户想要添加三个IO点：TI-201、PI-201、FI-201，都是AI类型，并且要带历史记录。当前阶段是ANALYZE_INTENT，可用工具包括manage_history和manage_points。用户的需求是添加点位，但目前manage_points只允许list_points操作，不允许创建点位。根据行为准则，如果当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，可以在回复的纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换到合适的阶段。可切换的下一阶段包括CONFIG_POINT（配置点位），这应该适合创建点位。另外，用户还提到要\"带历史\"，这意味着可能需要配置历史记录，所以也可能需要切换到CONFIG_HISTORY阶段。但首先应该创建点位。我需要先切换到CONFIG_POINT阶段。在回复中，我需要包含\"next_state: CONFIG_POINT\"。同时，我也应该询问用户关于点位的具体配置参数，比如描述、单位、量程等。但根据当前阶段，我应该先切换到合适的阶段。所以，我会回复一个纯文本，说明我将切换到CONFIG_POINT阶段，并询问用户是否需要提供这些点位的更多配置细节。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1431, "output_tokens": 433, "latency_ms": 16082.36179999949, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户已确认进入CONFIG_POINT阶段，现在需要创建三个AI点位（TI-201、PI-201、FI-201）并配置历史记录。首先需要调用manage_points工具来创建点位。但当前工具列表显示manage_points只允许list_points操作，没有create_points操作。这说明在CONFIG_POINT阶段，可能需要通过其他方式创建点位，或者需要等待用户切换阶段。然而，根据工作流上下文，当前workflow=HistoryQuery，step=check_history_config，这暗示可能需要先检查历史配置。用户明确要求创建点位，但当前工具不支持。我需要查看manage_points的完整功能描述：它是\"Create / update / delete / list SCADA points (tags)\"，但当前允许的actions只有list_points。这意味着在CONFIG_POINT阶段，可能无法直接创建点位，或者需要先列出点位以了解现有配置。也许创建点位的功能需要其他action，但当前阶段未开放。我应该先使用list_points查看现有点位，了解项目状态，然后决定下一步。用户还提到\"带历史\"，这可能意味着需要配置历史记录。当前阶段是CONFIG_POINT，可切换的下一阶段包括CONFIG_HISTORY。或许需要先创建点位，然后切换到CONFIG_HISTORY阶段配置历史。但创建点位的工具不可用，这可能是个问题。也许我需要询问用户更详细的点位信息，或者系统可能通过其他方式（如脚本）创建点位。根据行为准则，如果当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，可以在回复中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换阶段。但用户明确要求创建点位，而CONFIG_POINT阶段应该能够创建点位，但工具限制只有list_points。这可能意味着需要先列出点位，或者系统通过其他机制创建。让我先调用list_points查看现有情况。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2303, "output_tokens": 367, "latency_ms": 13276.271099999576, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户要求创建三个AI点位（TI-201、PI-201、FI-201）并配置历史记录。当前处于CONFIG_HISTORY阶段，可用工具是manage_history（允许enable_history、list_history、set_retention）和manage_points（仅允许list_points）。我无法直接创建点位，因为manage_points只支持list_points操作。\n\n首先，我需要确认这些点位是否存在。刚刚调用list_points显示有0个点位，说明这些点位还未创建。用户需要先创建点位才能配置历史。但当前工具无法创建点位。\n\n根据行为准则，如果当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，我可以在回复的纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换到合适的阶段。可切换的下一阶段包括：CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, VALIDATE。这里没有CONFIG_POINT阶段，但也许需要回到CONFIG_POINT？等等，上一个用户消息说\"你已进入 CONFIG_POINT 阶段\"，然后现在又说\"你已进入 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段\"。可能阶段已自动切换。我需要先处理历史配置，但点位不存在。\n\n我应该向用户说明情况：点位尚未创建，需要先创建点位才能配置历史。然后建议切换到点位创建阶段。但可切换的下一阶段中没有明确的CONFIG_POINT。也许需要询问用户下一步操作。\n\n或者，我可以先使用manage_history的list_history来查看当前历史配置情况，但这可能也显示为空。\n\n让我先调用list_history看看。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2351, "output_tokens": 607, "latency_ms": 22791.78519999914, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我已经查看了当前项目状态：\n\n1. **点位状态**：项目中没有任何点位（共0个点位）\n2. **历史配置**：项目中没有任何历史配置（共0个历史记录）\n\n您要求创建三个AI点位（TI-201、PI-201、FI-201）并配置历史记录，但当前在CONFIG_POINT阶段，我的可用工具**只能列出点位**，无法创建新点位。\n\n**建议方案：**\n1. 我需要能够创建点位的工具权限才能完成您的请求\n2. 或者，您可以提供这些点位的详细配置信息，我可以为您生成配置方案供您手动创建\n\n您希望我：\nA. 切换到其他可能支持创建点位的阶段？\nB. 为您生成详细的点位配置方案？\nC. 等待系统提供创建点位的工具权限？\n\n请告诉我您希望如何进行。", "reasoning": "我收到了系统消息，说我已进入CONFIG_POINT阶段和CONFIG_HISTORY阶段。我需要检查当前可用的工具。根据之前的工具列表，我有manage_points和manage_history。但manage_points只允许list_points，不能创建点位。manage_history允许enable_history、list_history、set_retention。\n\n用户最初的需求是创建三个AI点位（TI-201、PI-201、FI-201）并带历史配置。目前点位列表为空，历史列表也为空。我无法创建点位，因为工具限制。\n\n然而，系统消息说\"你已进入 CONFIG_POINT 阶段\"，这意味着可能现在可以使用更多manage_points的actions？但工具描述中明确说\"Currently allowed actions: list_points\"。这可能是一个测试环境，我需要按照允许的actions来操作。\n\n我可以先列出点位确认当前状态，然后尝试配置历史。但历史配置需要点位存在。我需要向用户说明当前工具限制，并建议如何创建点位。或者询问是否可以使用其他方式创建点位。\n\n根据行为准则：若信息不足，先调用查询类工具或向用户确认。我已调用list_points，显示0个点位。我需要确认用户是否希望我通过其他方式创建点位，或者是否需要切换到其他阶段。\n\n我应该回复用户，说明当前情况：点位尚未创建，我无法在当前阶段创建点位，因为工具限制只允许list_points操作。询问用户是否需要我帮助切换到其他阶段，或者是否可以使用其他方式创建点位。\n\n但根据高危操作安全准则，我不能跳过校验。创建点位可能不是高危操作，但我不应该编造工具。\n\n我应该诚实地告诉用户当前限制。然后询问是否需要切换到其他阶段（如CONFIG_ALARM等），或者等待系统提供创建点位的工具。\n\n我将回复用户，说明情况并询问下一步。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "HistoryQuery"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 7074, "output_tokens": 1834, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 67234.54340000171}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "d93a28df-4388-4aa5-8a5f-1ce4a9306342", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-015", "text": "给TI-201 set一个HH alarm和LL alarm，分别在100和10，priority设为high", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "alarm"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T08:57:05.577Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T08:57:32.391Z", "total_turns": 3, "terminal_state": "DONE", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T08:57:05.577Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T08:57:12.112Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T08:57:12.112Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T08:57:32.391Z"}, {"name": "DONE", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T08:57:32.391Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T08:57:32.391Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "points": [{"tag": "TI-201", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.333700001850957, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_digital_alarm", "create_analog_alarm", "set_threshold", "delete_alarm", "disable_alarm", "enable_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_alarms", "action": "create_analog_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "alarm_TI-201_HH", "tag": "TI-201", "high_limit": "100", "priority": "high"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "alarm_TI-201_HH"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.alarm_TI-201_HH": {"id": "alarm_TI-201_HH", "tag": "TI-201", "type": "analog", "high_limit": 100.0, "low_limit": null, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "high", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 1.4563000004272908, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_TI-201_HH"], "referenced_entities": ["points.TI-201"]}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_digital_alarm", "create_analog_alarm", "set_threshold", "delete_alarm", "disable_alarm", "enable_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_alarms", "action": "create_analog_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "alarm_TI-201_LL", "tag": "TI-201", "low_limit": "10", "priority": "high"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "alarm_TI-201_LL"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.alarm_TI-201_LL": {"id": "alarm_TI-201_LL", "tag": "TI-201", "type": "analog", "high_limit": null, "low_limit": 10.0, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "high", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 1.1818000020866748, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_TI-201_LL"], "referenced_entities": ["points.TI-201"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:5c36a73b4c1d2de1572720df5fcdfadf57212e64b3121822dbe294c91f962227", "final_hash": "sha256:5a1c6f15576a889943a0c28db6202e65f73eaa72e2592bdbcbeb549fe2269fb6", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 974, "output_tokens": 168, "latency_ms": 6530.084100002568, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我需要先查看项目中是否已存在点位 **TI-201**，以便后续为其配置报警。让我先查询一下所有点位信息。", "reasoning": "The user wants to set HH (High-High) and LL (Low-Low) alarms for a point called \"TI-201\", with:\n- HH alarm at 100\n- LL alarm at 10\n- Both with high priority\n\nI'm currently in the ANALYZE_INTENT stage, and the current workflow is AlarmConfig, step=discover_points.\n\nLet me first check what points are available to see if TI-201 exists. I can use the manage_points tool to list points."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2069, "output_tokens": 273, "latency_ms": 8091.876299997239, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "点位 **TI-201** 已存在且为模拟量点位。现在我来为您创建 HH 和 LL 两个报警。", "reasoning": "The point TI-201 exists and is an analog point. Now I need to create two analog alarms:\n\n1. HH (High-High) alarm at 100, priority high\n2. LL (Low-Low) alarm at 10, priority high\n\nI'll create both alarms using the manage_alarms tool with create_analog_alarm action. I can make both calls at the same time since they are independent."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 7189, "output_tokens": 364, "latency_ms": 12163.53419999723, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "报警配置已全部完成！以下是配置摘要：\n\n| 报警 ID | 监控点位 | 报警类型 | 阈值 | 优先级 |\n|---------|---------|---------|------|--------|\n| `alarm_TI-201_HH` | TI-201 | 高高报 (HH) | ≥ 100 | 🔴 high |\n| `alarm_TI-201_LL` | TI-201 | 低低报 (LL) | ≤ 10 | 🔴 high |\n\n两个报警均已成功创建并默认启用。\n\n接下来您还可以：\n- **配置报警通知**：设置当报警触发时如何通知操作员（邮件、短信等）\n- **绑定到 HMI 页面**：将报警显示在画面上\n- **配置报警历史记录**：设置报警日志的存储和保留策略\n- **编写报警脚本**：在报警触发时执行自定义逻辑\n\n如需继续其他配置，请告诉我；如果报警配置任务已完成，请回复确认。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "The user is reminding me that I'm in the CONFIG_ALARM stage. Both alarms have been successfully created. Let me summarize what was done for the user.\n\nThe task is complete:\n1. Created HH alarm (alarm_TI-201_HH) for TI-201 at high_limit=100, priority=high\n2. Created LL alarm (alarm_TI-201_LL) for TI-201 at low_limit=10, priority=high\n\nI should inform the user that the task is complete and since the current stage is CONFIG_ALARM and the alarm configuration is done, I should suggest moving to the next appropriate stage or finishing."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 10232, "output_tokens": 805, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 26814.15989999732}, "judge": null}
