alarm_TI201_HH) - high limit at 100, priority high\n2. LL alarm (alarm_TI201_LL) - low limit at 10, priority high\n\nThe task is done. I should inform the user and include \"next_state: DONE\" to end the task."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 10323, "output_tokens": 789, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 26228.115199999593}, "judge": null}
