 1.528099997813115, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:5c36a73b4c1d2de1572720df5fcdfadf57212e64b3121822dbe294c91f962227", "final_hash": "sha256:af55d165b3ef2bca86c71ae4b9e635a9821c1b293d1a8059ddf10b191dd445f2", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 974, "output_tokens": 341, "latency_ms": 13742.246999998315, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想要为TI-201点位设置HH和LL报警，阈值分别为100和10，优先级设为high。当前工作流阶段是ANALYZE_INTENT，可用的工具只有manage_pages和manage_points，而且都只是查询功能（list操作）。要设置报警，我需要能够配置报警的工具，但当前阶段没有提供这样的工具。\n\n根据行为准则，如果当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，我可以在回复的纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段。可切换的下一阶段包括：ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE。\n\n用户的需求是配置报警，这应该属于CONFIG_ALARM阶段。所以我需要切换到CONFIG_ALARM阶段。不过，在切换之前，我应该先确认TI-201点位是否存在。这可以通过manage_points工具来查询。既然当前阶段有这个工具，我可以先调用它来列出点位，看看TI-201是否存在。\n\n那么，我先调用manage_points来列出所有点位，确认TI-201的存在。然后，如果点位存在，我就切换到CONFIG_ALARM阶段。如果不存在，我需要先创建点位（这可能需要切换到CONFIG_POINT阶段）。但用户没有提到创建点位，只是要求设置报警。所以最好先检查一下。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2242, "output_tokens": 397, "latency_ms": 13587.790000001405, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "现在处于CONFIG_ALARM阶段，需要为TI-201点位创建HH和LL报警。可用的工具有manage_alarms和manage_points（仅list_points）。需要创建模拟报警（analog alarm），因为TI-201是模拟量点位。应该使用manage_alarms的create_analog_alarm操作。\n\n需要创建两个报警：一个HH报警（高高报警）阈值为100，一个LL报警（低低报警）阈值为10。用户说\"HH alarm和LL alarm\"，这通常意味着高高和低低报警。需要为每个报警设置不同的ID。例如，可以命名为\"alarm_TI201_HH\"和\"alarm_TI201_LL\"。优先级都设为high。deadband可以设为0或默认值0。\n\n先创建HH报警：action为create_analog_alarm，id为\"alarm_TI201_HH\"，tag为\"TI-201\"，high_limit为100，low_limit为null，deadband为0，priority为\"high\"。\n\n然后创建LL报警：action为create_analog_alarm，id为\"alarm_TI201_LL\"，tag为\"TI-201\"，high_limit为null，low_limit为10，deadband为0，priority为\"high\"。\n\n调用manage_alarms工具两次。先调用第一个。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2713, "output_tokens": 358, "latency_ms": 13575.776500001666, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "报错显示low_limit不能是null字符串，需要将null转换为JSON null。在JSON中，null应该直接写为null，而不是字符串\"null\"。重新调用，使用正确的null值。先创建HH报警，high_limit=100，low_limit=null（JSON null）。在JSON模式中，null应该被表示为null值。实际上，JSON Schema允许null值，但需要确保参数中正确传递null。可能工具期望的是JSON null，而不是字符串。需要尝试不同的方式。可能low_limit参数需要省略，或者设为null。查看Schema：low_limit是\"anyOf\": [{\"type\": \"number\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}]，所以可以接受null。但如何表示null？在JSON中直接写null。在调用工具时，对于null值，可能需要使用特殊表示。之前的错误提示是\"unable to parse string as a number\"，说明low_limit被解析为字符串了。也许需要确保不传递该参数，或传递null。试试不传递low_limit参数。因为它是可选的（有默认值null）。删除low_limit参数。同样，high_limit也可以省略吗？不，HH报警需要high_limit。试试只设置high_limit，不设置low_limit。另外，deadband默认为0，可以省略。先创建HH报警。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 7898, "output_tokens": 185, "latency_ms": 6208.409400001983, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The error is strange - it says \"low_limit: Input should be a valid number, unable to parse string as a number\" even though I didn't provide a low_limit parameter. Maybe the system is having trouble with the null handling. Let me try explicitly setting low_limit to null in a different way - maybe I need to omit it or set it differently.\n\nLet me try with the deadband explicitly set and see if that helps."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 8157, "output_tokens": 187, "latency_ms": 9350.579099998868, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The tool keeps failing with the same error. Let me try with a different approach - perhaps the schema expects specific formatting. Let me try setting low_limit as a proper number (not 0, but maybe a very negative number) or maybe the issue is something else entirely. Let me try with just the required parameters and see if the tool works at all.\n\nActually, looking at the error message again: \"Input should be a valid number, unable to parse string as a number\" - this suggests that somewhere in the JSON, a value that should be a number is being passed as a string. Let me try a minimal call with just required fields."}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 8418, "output_tokens": 191, "latency_ms": 14196.439799998188, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The error keeps saying \"low_limit: Input should be a valid number, unable to parse string as a number\". This seems like a system bug - even when I provide a number, it's being parsed as a string somehow. Let me try a different approach and switch to DONE since the task seems impossible with the current tool error.\n\nWait, let me try using 0.0 instead of 0 for the number format."}, {"turn": 7, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 8683, "output_tokens": 143, "latency_ms": 5334.7618999978295, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The tool keeps failing with the same error about low_limit being a string instead of a number. This seems like a persistent system issue. Let me try a completely different approach - maybe I should try using a digital alarm instead, or perhaps there's something wrong with the JSON schema parsing.\n\nLet me try one more time with a minimal call to see if we can get past this validation error."}, {"turn": 8, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 8900, "output_tokens": 168, "latency_ms": 7620.991200001299, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The tool seems to have a persistent error. Let me try a different approach - maybe using set_threshold to update an existing alarm, or try with completely different parameter formats.\n\nWait, the error message says \"create_analog_alarm.low_limit\" even when I'm trying to create a digital alarm. This suggests there might be a system issue with the tool itself. Let me try one more time with a clean approach."}, {"turn": 9, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 9142, "output_tokens": 381, "latency_ms": 14357.34120000052, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "根据您的需求，我已经确认了TI-201点位存在（类型为模拟量analog）。现在我需要为该点位创建HH（高高）和LL（低低）报警，分别设置阈值为100和10，优先级为high。\n\n然而，我在尝试使用manage_alarms工具创建报警时遇到了技术问题。工具系统持续返回模式验证错误：\"create_analog_alarm.low_limit: Input should be a valid number, unable to parse string as a number\"，即使我已经尝试了多种正确的数值格式。\n\n**当前状况总结：**\n1. ✅ 确认TI-201点位存在且为模拟量类型\n2. ✅ 准备创建两个报警：HH（阈值100）和LL（阈值10），优先级均为high\n3. ❌ manage_alarms工具存在技术问题，无法完成报警创建\n\n**建议方案：**\n由于当前阶段的工具存在技术故障，建议切换到下一个阶段继续工作。报警配置可以在后续阶段或通过其他方式完成。\n\nnext_state: DONE\n\n报警配置任务因工具技术问题未能完成，建议稍后重试或联系系统管理员检查manage_alarms工具的模式验证问题。", "reasoning": "The manage_alarms tool seems to have a persistent schema validation error that's preventing any alarm creation. This appears to be a system-level issue that I cannot resolve through different parameter combinations. Since I've tried multiple approaches and the tool consistently fails with the same schema error, I should inform the user about this technical limitation and suggest moving to the next state to continue the workflow.\n\nLet me try one more time with the exact parameters as specified in the schema, but it seems like there's a bug in the tool itself. I should inform the user about this issue."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 57127, "output_tokens": 2351, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 98102.48839999986}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "5737d975-b3a6-462c-b9b9-3e09d3762260", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-016", "text": "在chemical screen加个tank，绑到TI-201上，另外加个button用于start", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T08:58:38.446Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:11.301Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "GENERATE_LAYOUT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "MANAGE_PAGES", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T08:58:38.446Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T08:58:43.545Z"}, {"name": "GENERATE_LAYOUT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T08:58:43.545Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:11.301Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "MANAGE_PAGES", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["create_widget", "create_page", "list_pages"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "pages": [{"id": "chem_screen", "name": "chemical screen"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.4264999990700744, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:fcecac1dae4dfaf00fb3049afcbdce0448e44c2f01436ef07ea9f3346a61faab", "final_hash": "sha256:fcecac1dae4dfaf00fb3049afcbdce0448e44c2f01436ef07ea9f3346a61faab", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1298, "output_tokens": 99, "latency_ms": 5093.8819000002695, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我先查看一下当前项目中有哪些页面，确认 \"chemical screen\" 的页面ID。", "reasoning": "The user wants to:\n1. Add a tank widget to the \"chemical screen\" page, bound to TI-201\n2. Add a button widget for \"start\"\n\nLet me first list the pages to find the correct page_id for the \"chemical screen\"."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2058, "output_tokens": 794, "latency_ms": 27750.571900000068, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "根据当前阶段可用的工具，我需要向您说明以下情况：\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ 当前工具能力限制\n\n在 **GENERATE_LAYOUT** 阶段，`manage_graphics` 工具仅支持以下操作：\n- **create_text** — 创建静态文本标签\n- **create_line** — 绘制线条（如管道段）\n- **group_widgets** — 将已有控件分组\n- **set_widget_style** — 设置控件样式\n- **apply_flow_layout** — 流式布局排列\n\n**不支持**创建以下控件：\n- ❌ **Tank（储罐）** 控件\n- ❌ **Button（按钮）** 控件\n\n此外，**点位绑定（TI-201）** 需要在 **BIND_POINTS** 阶段完成，当前阶段也无法执行。\n\n---\n\n### 💡 建议方案\n\n1. **创建 Tank 控件和 Button 控件** — 需要切换到具有完整控件创建能力的阶段（如 `MANAGE_PAGES`）来添加 tank 和 button 控件。\n\n2. **绑定 TI-201** — 控件创建完成后，切换到 `BIND_POINTS` 阶段完成点位绑定。\n\n---\n\n您希望我：\n- **切换到 `MANAGE_PAGES` 阶段** 来创建 tank 和 button 控件？\n- 还是先用当前工具做一个 **layout 占位布局**（如用文本标签和线条画出储罐区域的示意图），后续再替换为真正的控件？\n\n请确认您的选择，我来继续操作！", "reasoning": "The user wants me to:\n1. Add a tank widget to the \"chemical screen\" page, bound to TI-201\n2. Add a button widget for \"start\"\n\nLooking at the current available tools in the GENERATE_LAYOUT stage:\n- manage_graphics: create_text, create_line, group_widgets, set_widget_style, apply_flow_layout\n- manage_pages: list_pages\n\nThe manage_graphics tool only supports:\n- create_text: Static text labels\n- create_line: Line primitives (pipe segments)\n- group_widgets: Group existing widgets\n- set_widget_style: Style existing widgets\n- apply_flow_layout: Re-position widgets\n\nI don't have tools to create a tank widget or a button widget in the current stage. The user needs tank and button widgets, but these are not available through the current tools.\n\nAlso, binding a widget to a point (TI-201) would typically be done in the BIND_POINTS stage, not the GENERATE_LAYOUT stage.\n\nI should inform the user that:\n1. The current tools don't support creating tank or button widgets - I can only create text labels and lines\n2. Point binding is not available in this stage\n\nI should suggest switching to another stage that might have more widget creation capabilities. Let me check the available next states: BIND_POINTS, DEPLOY, DONE, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\nActually, none of these seem to directly handle widget creation for tanks and buttons. The current stage GENERATE_LAYOUT seems to be the one for layout, but the tools are limited to text, lines, and layout management.\n\nI should be honest with the user about the limitations and suggest what we can do with the available tools, or propose switching to a more appropriate stage if one exists.\n\nWait, let me re-read the tool descriptions. The manage_graphics tool says \"Graphical primitives, layouts, grouping, styling.\" It's limited to text and lines as primitives.\n\nI need to tell the user that the current toolset doesn't support creating tank or button widgets. \n\nThe available primitives are restricted to text labels and line elements. I should explain this constraint and ask whether they'd like to explore alternative stages or work with the tools currently available."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "ChemicalProductionScreen"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 3356, "output_tokens": 893, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 32855.31980000087}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "2e1b66fb-034b-462d-8a6f-972a0cad1f83", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-013", "text": "建两个页面，一个叫报警汇总，一个叫报表，都用黑底，顺便把报表页大小设成4K", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "page"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T08:58:59.792Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:27.223Z", "total_turns": 1, "terminal_state": "UNKNOWN", "early_terminated": true, "termination_reason": "no finish() call"}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T08:58:59.792Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:16.983Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:16.983Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:27.223Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "pages": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.4518000025418587, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": null, "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 974, "output_tokens": 209, "latency_ms": 17184.86380000104, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户的需求是创建两个HMI页面：一个叫\"报警汇总\"，一个叫\"报表\"。两个页面都要用黑底，并且报表页大小要设成4K。\n\n当前阶段是ANALYZE_INTENT，可用工具只有manage_pages（可以list_pages）和manage_points（可以list_points）。目前manage_pages允许的操作只有list_pages，还没有创建页面的功能。因此，我无法直接创建页面。\n\n我需要先检查一下当前有哪些页面，然后根据情况建议下一步操作。我可以调用manage_pages的list_pages来查看现有页面。如果用户坚持要创建页面，我需要切换到MANAGE_PAGES阶段，那里可能有创建页面的功能。但根据工具列表，当前manage_pages只允许list_pages操作，所以我可能需要先向用户说明情况，然后建议切换到MANAGE_PAGES阶段。\n\n让我先调用list_pages看看现有页面情况。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 974, "output_tokens": 209, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 27430.706700000883}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "e8ac807c-6d3b-417f-b376-16a89ef729d5", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-017", "text": "帮我把全厂所有的点都加上历史，然后导出来", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "history"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:11.676Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:41.339Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:11.676Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:17.159Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:17.159Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:41.339Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 2, "points": [{"tag": "P1", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}, {"tag": "P2", "type": "digital", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.394599999912316, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_history", "action": "list_history", "args": {"action": "list_history"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "histories": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.2607000026036985, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:621a63847510f896127d367c0ca566b2205f7109b72d13e1d89c0b32df465bc4", "final_hash": "sha256:621a63847510f896127d367c0ca566b2205f7109b72d13e1d89c0b32df465bc4", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 972, "output_tokens": 121, "latency_ms": 5476.67239999646, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我先帮您查看当前所有点位和历史配置的情况。", "reasoning": "The user is asking to add history recording to all plant points and then export them. Let me first check what points are currently configured and what history configuration exists.\n\nI should:\n1. List all current points\n2. List current history configuration\n\nLet me do both calls simultaneously since they're independent."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1196, "output_tokens": 516, "latency_ms": 24176.81040000025, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "根据当前阶段的工具能力，我需要向您说明情况：\n\n**当前状态：**\n- 全厂共有 **2 个点位**：`P1`（模拟量）、`P2`（数字量）\n- 历史归档配置：**0 条**（尚未配置任何历史记录）\n\n**存在的问题：**\n\n很抱歉，当前 `manage_history` 工具仅支持以下操作：\n1. ✅ **查询**已配置的历史标签列表 (`list_history`)\n2. ✅ **查询**某个标签的历史数据窗口 (`query_history`)\n3. ❌ **不支持**添加/配置历史归档\n4. ❌ **不支持**导出历史数据\n\n---\n\n**建议方案：**\n\n要完成您的需求（为所有点添加历史 + 导出），我们需要切换到 **CONFIG_SCRIPT** 阶段，通过脚本来批量配置历史归档，或者切换到 **DEPLOY** 阶段进行完整配置。\n\n如果您希望，我可以先切换到其他阶段尝试完成您的需求。请确认：\n\n1. **是否切换到 CONFIG_SCRIPT 阶段**？（可能通过脚本实现批量配置）\n2. 或者您只需要我**查询现有数据**？\n\n请告知您希望如何继续？", "reasoning": "The user wants to add history to all points in the plant. I can see that there are currently 2 points (P1 and P2) but no history configurations exist yet.\n\nHowever, looking at my current available tools, I only have access to `manage_history` which only allows:\n- `list_history`: List the configured historian tags and their parameters\n- `query_history`: Read a synthetic historical window for a tag\n\nI don't have access to:\n- `manage_points` (which I just called - but this was from a previous context/stage apparently)\n- `add_history` or similar action to CREATE history configurations\n- Any export functionality\n\nThe `manage_history` tool in the current CONFIG_HISTORY stage only supports `list_history` and `query_history` actions. I cannot:\n1. Add/configure history for points - there's no `add_history` or `update_history` action available\n2. Export data - there's no export functionality\n\nI should inform the user about these limitations and suggest we may need to move to a different stage that has more capabilities, or clarify what's possible.\n\nLet me be honest with the user about what I can and cannot do with the current tools."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "HistoryQuery"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 2168, "output_tokens": 637, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 29663.162900000316}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "265c0b9a-8c0c-4896-b9a3-af1b5b593f87", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-013", "text": "建两个页面，一个叫报警汇总，一个叫报表，都用黑底，顺便把报表页大小设成4K", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "page"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:27.224Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T09:00:12.429Z", "total_turns": 3, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:27.224Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:45.327Z"}, {"name": "MANAGE_PAGES", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:45.327Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:57.204Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:57.204Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T09:00:12.429Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 2, "state": "MANAGE_PAGES", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "pages": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.4063999988138676, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 974, "output_tokens": 412, "latency_ms": 18099.106499998015, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我了解您的需求：\n\n1. 创建两个页面：**报警汇总** 和 **报表**\n2. 两个页面都使用黑底背景\n3. 报表页面大小设为 4K 分辨率\n\n当前阶段下，页面管理工具仅支持查看页面列表，不支持创建和配置页面。我需要切换到 **MANAGE_PAGES** 阶段才能完成页面创建和配置操作。\n\nnext_state: MANAGE_PAGES", "reasoning": "The user wants to:\n1. Create two pages: \"报警汇总\" (Alarm Summary) and \"报表\" (Report)\n2. Both should have black background\n3. The \"报表\" (Report) page should be set to 4K resolution\n\nLooking at my available tools:\n- manage_pages: Currently only allows \"list_pages\" action - it can only list pages, not create or configure them\n- manage_points: Only allows \"list_points\" action\n\nThe current stage is ANALYZE_INTENT, and the available tools for manage_pages only support \"list_pages\" - I cannot create pages or configure them (like setting background color or size) with the current tools.\n\nSince the user's request involves creating pages and configuring their properties, and the current tools don't support this, I should:\n1. Acknowledge the request\n2. Explain that I need to switch to a stage that supports page creation/configuration\n\nAccording to the behavior rules: \"若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，你可以在回复的纯文本中包含 'next_state: 阶段名' 来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段\"\n\nLooking at the available next stages: ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\n\"MANAGE_PAGES\" seems like the right stage to switch to for creating and configuring pages.\n\nLet me first acknowledge the user's request and then switch to the appropriate stage."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1399, "output_tokens": 221, "latency_ms": 11870.502299996588, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "当前阶段虽然已切换到 MANAGE_PAGES，但页面管理工具目前仅支持**查看页面列表**功能，不支持创建新页面或配置页面属性（如背景颜色、分辨率等）。\n\n让我先查看一下当前项目中已有的页面情况：", "reasoning": "The user has confirmed I'm now in the MANAGE_PAGES stage. However, looking at my available tools, I still only see:\n- manage_pages: Currently only allows \"list_pages\" action\n- manage_points: Only allows \"list_points\" action\n\nThe manage_pages tool still only supports the \"list_pages\" action. I cannot create pages or configure them (set background color, size, etc.) with the current available actions.\n\nI should be honest with the user about this limitation. The tools available to me don't support creating or configuring pages - they only support listing pages.\n\nLet me try to call list_pages first to see what pages currently exist, and then inform the user about the limitation."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2547, "output_tokens": 389, "latency_ms": 15219.008699998085, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我理解您想创建两个页面（报警汇总和报表），并设置背景和分辨率。\n\n但是，**当前阶段（CONFIG_ALARM）下我无法完成页面创建和配置任务**。原因如下：\n\n1. **当前可用工具不支持页面创建**：manage_pages 工具目前仅支持 `list_pages`（查看页面列表），不支持创建页面、设置背景颜色或配置分辨率等操作。\n\n2. **页面创建功能尚未开放**：根据当前工具配置，页面的创建和属性配置（如背景颜色、4K分辨率设置）不在当前可用的操作范围内。\n\n**您的需求记录如下：**\n| 页面名称 | 背景颜色 | 分辨率 |\n|---------|---------|--------|\n| 报警汇总 | 黑色 | 默认 |\n| 报表 | 黑色 | 4K |\n\n建议您：\n1. 联系系统管理员开通页面创建权限\n2. 或者在系统配置界面中手动创建这两个页面\n\n请问是否有其他我可以协助完成的任务？例如配置报警或管理点位？", "reasoning": "The user wants me to create two pages: \"报警汇总\" (Alarm Summary) and \"报表\" (Report), both with black background, and the report page should be set to 4K resolution.\n\nHowever, looking at the current available tools:\n- manage_pages: only supports \"list_pages\" action\n- manage_points: only supports \"list_points\" action\n\nThere is no \"create_page\" or \"configure_page\" action available. The manage_pages tool currently only supports listing pages.\n\nSince I cannot perform the requested operation with the current available tools, I should inform the user about this limitation. The tools don't support creating pages or configuring page properties (background color, resolution).\n\nI should be honest with the user that the current toolset doesn't support page creation or configuration - only listing pages is available."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 4920, "output_tokens": 1022, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 45205.51749999868}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "a21843e7-ff34-4ef4-9c73-f09194478f14", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-017", "text": "帮我把全厂所有的点都加上历史，然后导出来", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "history"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:41.712Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T09:00:48.015Z", "total_turns": 4, "terminal_state": "DONE", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:41.713Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:52.667Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T08:59:52.667Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T09:00:48.015Z"}, {"name": "DONE", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T09:00:48.015Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T09:00:48.015Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 2, "points": [{"tag": "P1", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}, {"tag": "P2", "type": "digital", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.3604999985545874, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_history", "action": "list_history", "args": {"action": "list_history"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "histories": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.1571000031835865, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history", "query_history"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "manage_history", "action": "query_history", "args": {"action": "query_history", "tag": "P1"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": false, "error_code": "POINT_NOT_FOUND", "error_msg": "history config for P1 not found", "result_data": {}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.3280000021040905, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": ["histories.P1"]}, {"turn": 3, "state": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history", "query_history"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "manage_history", "action": "query_history", "args": {"action": "query_history", "tag": "P2"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": false, "error_code": "POINT_NOT_FOUND", "error_msg": "history config for P2 not found", "result_data": {}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.3202999980421737, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": ["histories.P2"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:621a63847510f896127d367c0ca566b2205f7109b72d13e1d89c0b32df465bc4", "final_hash": "sha256:621a63847510f896127d367c0ca566b2205f7109b72d13e1d89c0b32df465bc4", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 972, "output_tokens": 338, "latency_ms": 10949.728899999172, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想要把全厂所有的点都加上历史记录，然后导出。这涉及两个主要步骤：\n1. 获取所有现有的点（tags）\n2. 为这些点配置历史记录（historian configuration）\n\n但当前的工具限制：manage_points 只能列出点，不能创建或修改。manage_history 只能列出历史配置，不能创建或修改。\n\n根据工作流上下文：当前 workflow=HistoryQuery, step=check_history_config。这意味着我们正在检查历史配置。\n\n行为准则第5条：若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，可以在回复中包含 \"next_state: 阶段名\" 来切换到可切换的下一阶段中的合适阶段。\n\n可切换的下一阶段包括：ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE。\n\n用户的需求是\"把全厂所有的点都加上历史\"，这需要配置历史记录，所以应该切换到 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段。同时需要先获取所有点，这可能需要在 CONFIG_POINT 阶段或 BIND_POINTS 阶段进行。\n\n但首先，我需要了解当前系统中有哪些点，以及当前的历史配置。所以我应该先调用查询工具。\n\n让我先列出所有点，然后列出历史配置，看看哪些点已经配置了历史，哪些还没有。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1413, "output_tokens": 417, "latency_ms": 18480.478099998436, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "当前在CONFIG_HISTORY阶段，可用的工具只有manage_history，支持list_history和query_history两个action。用户想要\"把全厂所有的点都加上历史，然后导出来\"。但是，当前的工具只能查询历史配置和模拟历史数据查询，不能添加或修改历史配置。也就是说，我无法直接为所有点添加历史记录。\n\n不过，我可以先列出当前所有点（已经从上一步得知有P1和P2两个点），然后查看历史配置（当前为空）。用户还想要\"导出来\"，可能是指导出历史数据或配置。\n\n由于当前工具不支持添加历史配置，我需要告知用户当前限制，并建议下一步。根据行为准则，如果当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，可以在回复中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换到合适的阶段。\n\n可切换的下一阶段包括：CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, VALIDATE。但没有直接的\"添加历史配置\"的阶段。也许需要回到更早的阶段，或者需要其他工具。但根据工具列表，只有这些阶段。\n\n也许用户需要的是先查询历史数据？用户说\"导出来\"，可能是想导出历史数据。我可以使用query_history来模拟查询历史数据，但需要指定tag、window_s和max_samples参数。\n\n但用户说\"把全厂所有的点都加上历史\"，这明显是配置操作，而非查询。当前工具无法完成。\n\n因此，我需要向用户说明当前工具的限制，并建议切换到其他阶段或提供其他方案。根据行为准则，我应该在回复中说明情况，并可能建议切换到DONE阶段结束任务，或者询问用户是否想查询历史数据。\n\n让我先尝试查询一下P1的历史数据，看看效果。使用默认参数：window_s=60, max_samples=20。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1889, "output_tokens": 347, "latency_ms": 15162.16059999715, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户希望为全厂所有点添加历史记录并导出。当前阶段是CONFIG_HISTORY，可用工具只有manage_history，支持list_history和query_history。list_history只能列出已配置的历史记录，query_history只能查询合成历史数据。无法添加或修改历史记录配置。\n\n用户说\"把全厂所有的点都加上历史\"，这需要配置操作，但当前工具不支持。用户还要求\"导出来\"，可能是指导出历史数据或配置。\n\n根据行为准则第5条：若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，可以在回复的纯文本中包含 \"next_state: 阶段名\" 来切换到可切换的下一阶段中的合适阶段。可切换的下一阶段包括：CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, VALIDATE。\n\n但这里的问题是，需要为点添加历史记录配置，这可能在其他阶段完成，比如CONFIG_POINT？但CONFIG_POINT不在可切换列表中。也许需要先回到更早的阶段？但可切换列表中没有CONFIG_POINT。\n\n或者，用户可能误解了功能。也许当前系统已经支持历史记录，只是需要激活？但list_history显示没有历史配置。\n\n我可以尝试查询P2的历史数据，但同样会是空的。\n\n我应该告知用户当前工具的限制，并建议下一步。既然无法添加历史记录，也许可以切换到DONE阶段结束，或者切换到VALIDATE阶段验证？但验证也没有意义。\n\n让我先尝试查询P2的历史数据，然后说明情况。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2295, "output_tokens": 548, "latency_ms": 21692.45090000186, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "根据当前配置情况，我需要向您说明：\n\n## 当前状态\n1. **点位列表**：系统中共有2个点位\n   - `P1`（模拟量）\n   - `P2`（数字量）\n\n2. **历史配置**：目前**没有**为任何点位配置历史记录\n\n## 工具限制说明\n当前阶段（CONFIG_HISTORY）的可用工具 `manage_history` 只能：\n- 列出已配置的历史记录（`list_history`）\n- 查询模拟历史数据（`query_history`）\n\n**无法执行以下操作**：\n- 添加或修改历史记录配置\n- 导出历史数据或配置\n- 为点位启用历史记录\n\n## 建议\n要完成\"为全厂所有点添加历史记录并导出\"的任务，需要：\n1. 切换到具有历史配置功能的阶段\n2. 或联系系统管理员进行历史配置\n\n由于当前工具无法满足您的需求，我将结束本次任务。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "用户想要为所有点添加历史记录并导出，但我只有manage_history工具，只能列出历史配置和查询模拟历史数据。当前没有配置任何历史记录。我无法添加或修改历史配置，只能查询。\n\n我需要告知用户当前工具的限制。根据行为准则，若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，可以在回复的纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换到可切换的下一阶段。可切换的下一阶段包括：CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, VALIDATE。\n\n也许用户需要先配置点本身？但当前阶段是CONFIG_HISTORY，而且我已经在CONFIG_HISTORY阶段了。用户说\"把全厂所有的点都加上历史\"，这需要配置历史记录，但当前工具不支持。也许需要切换到其他阶段？但可切换的下一阶段中没有配置点或历史配置的阶段。\n\n或者，也许用户想导出历史数据？但当前没有历史数据，因为没有配置历史记录。模拟查询也返回空。\n\n我应该向用户说明当前情况：系统中有两个点（P1和P2），但尚未配置任何历史记录。当前工具无法添加历史配置，只能查询现有配置。建议用户切换到其他阶段或联系管理员进行历史配置。\n\n然后根据行为准则，我可以在回复中包含\"next_state: DONE\"来结束任务，因为无法进一步操作。或者切换到VALIDATE阶段？但验证什么呢？\n\n让我先向用户说明情况，然后建议结束任务。我会在回复中包含\"next_state: DONE\"。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "HistoryQuery"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 6569, "output_tokens": 1650, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 66302.61120000068}, "judge": null}
