alid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "pages": [{"id": "main", "name": "主画面"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.4291000006778631, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:7594b0d339dd171671a56b95048f5db7ed6f220f510a7a336df0828ff5aea13a", "final_hash": "sha256:7594b0d339dd171671a56b95048f5db7ed6f220f510a7a336df0828ff5aea13a", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 6611, "output_tokens": 236, "latency_ms": 8068.820000000414, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮你复制主画面页面。首先，我需要查看现有的页面列表，找到主画面的详细信息。", "reasoning": "The user wants to duplicate a page called \"主画面\" (Main Page) and rename the copy to \"备用画面\" (Backup Page).\n\nLet me think about how to do this. Looking at the available tools:\n\n1. `manage_pages` has actions like: rename_page, list_pages, delete_page, create_page, create_widget, create_protocol, delete_record\n\nUnfortunately, there's no direct \"clone_page\" or \"duplicate_page\" action available. Let me first list the pages to find the \"主画面\" page and get its ID. Then I can try to create a new page and recreate its widgets.\n\nActually, let me first list the pages to see what's available and get the ID of \"主画面\". Then I'll need to figure out how to duplicate it - this might require creating a new page and recreating all widgets manually, which could be complex.\n\nLet me start by listing the pages."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 6897, "output_tokens": 397, "latency_ms": 19709.596599997894, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "找到了\"主画面\"（ID: `main`）。不过很抱歉，当前系统的工具集中**没有\"复制/克隆页面\"的功能**。\n\n现有的页面管理操作包括：\n- 创建新页面（空白）\n- 重命名页面\n- 删除页面\n- 创建控件\n\n**我可以为你做的事情：**\n1. ✅ 创建一个名为\"备用画面\"的**空白新页面**\n2. 然后你手动或告诉我需要哪些控件，我帮你逐个添加到新页面上\n\n但我**无法自动复制**主画面上已有的所有控件和布局。\n\n---\n\n你希望我怎么处理？\n- **方案A**：先创建一个空白的\"备用画面\"页面，之后再逐步配置控件？\n- **方案B**：如果你能告诉我主画面上有哪些控件/设备，我可以帮你在新页面上重建它们。", "reasoning": "I found the page \"主画面\" with id \"main\". Now I need to duplicate it. Unfortunately, there's no \"clone_page\" or \"duplicate_page\" action available in the manage_pages tool.\n\nThe available actions are:\n- rename_page\n- list_pages\n- delete_page\n- create_page\n- create_widget\n- create_protocol\n- delete_record\n\nSince there's no direct clone functionality, I should inform the user about this limitation. I can create a new blank page called \"备用画面\", but I cannot automatically copy all the widgets from \"主画面\" - there's no way to read the existing widgets from the page to duplicate them.\n\nWait, let me think about this more carefully. The tools available don't include a \"list_widgets\" or \"get_page_details\" action that would let me see what widgets are on the main page. And there's no clone_page action.\n\nI should be honest with the user - the current tools don't support page duplication/cloning. I can only create a new blank page."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 13508, "output_tokens": 633, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 27811.33299999783}, "judge": null}
