提供widget的ID和类型。\n\n让我先创建页面2，因为这是明确需要的。用户要求\"放个背景图\"，我可以设置一个默认背景，之后再调整。创建页面2时，background参数可以留空或设为默认值。但background参数是可选的，默认为\"#FFFFFF\"。我可以先创建页面2，之后再设置背景图。\n\n那么，先创建页面2："}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 7417, "output_tokens": 541, "latency_ms": 18278.564399999595, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "页面2已创建成功（ID: p2）。接下来需要处理移动图元和设置背景图。\n\n为了完成这些操作，我需要更多信息：\n\n1. **图元移动**：目前系统没有直接\"移动\"图元的功能。我可以：\n   - 在页面2上创建一个与页面1上相同的图元（需要知道widget类型、位置、大小等）\n   - 然后删除页面1上的原图元（如果需要）\n   \n   请提供：\n   - 页面1上要移动的图元的 **widget_id**\n   - 该图元的 **类型**（如 thermometer、tank、pump、rect 等）\n   - 在页面2上的 **目标位置** 和 **大小**\n   - 是否要删除页面1上的原图元？\n\n2. **背景图设置**：\n   - 您想要什么类型的背景？纯色、渐变、还是图片？\n   - 如果是图片，请提供图片路径或描述\n   - 如果是纯色，请提供颜色代码（如 #333333）\n\n请提供这些信息，我将为您完成配置。\n\nnext_state: ASK_USER", "reasoning": "页面2创建成功。现在我需要处理\"把图元从页面1拖到页面2\"这部分。由于没有直接的移动功能，我需要先知道页面1上有哪些widget。但工具中没有列出widget的功能。这可能意味着我需要向用户询问widget的详细信息。\n\n不过，也许用户期望我创建一个新的widget在页面2上，而不是实际移动。或者，用户可能认为页面1上已经有一个widget，想把它移到页面2。但我不知道widget的ID和类型。\n\n让我看看是否有其他方法。也许我可以调用manage_graphics中的某个操作来获取widget信息？但也没有列出widget的功能。\n\n因此，我需要向用户询问更多信息。我会用纯文本回复，询问widget的ID和类型，以及背景图的具体要求。同时，我会说明页面2已创建。\n\n另外，关于背景图：我可以询问用户想要什么类型的背景（颜色、图片等），以及如何设置。\n\n现在，我需要切换到ASK_USER阶段，因为需要更多用户输入。在回复中，我可以包含\"next_state: ASK_USER\"。但根据行为准则，如果当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，可以在回复的纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"。目前我在ANALYZE_INTENT阶段，但可用的工具可能不足以完成这个任务，因为我需要更多信息。\n\n所以，我会在回复中询问，并包含\"next_state: ASK_USER\"。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 7955, "output_tokens": 586, "latency_ms": 20512.06760000059, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我需要更多信息来完成您的需求：\n\n1. **关于图元移动**：\n   - 页面1上当前有哪些图元？请提供 **widget_id**（如 \"thermo1\"、\"tank1\" 等）\n   - 这些图元的 **类型** 是什么？（如 thermometer、tank、pump、rect 等）\n   - 您希望将它们移动到页面2的什么 **位置** 和 **大小**？\n   - 移动后是否需要 **删除** 页面1上的原图元？\n\n2. **关于背景图**：\n   - 您想要什么类型的背景？纯色、渐变还是图片？\n   - 如果是纯色，请提供颜色代码（如 #333333）\n   - 如果是图片，请提供图片路径或描述\n\n请提供这些具体信息，我将使用相应工具为您完成配置。\n\n（如果您不确定页面1上有哪些图元，我可以先帮助您创建一些示例图元用于测试）", "reasoning": "我需要继续完成任务，但当前处于ASK_USER阶段，可用的工具仍然是之前的那些。用户要求\"把图元从页面1拖到页面2，顺便放个背景图\"，但我需要更多信息才能执行操作。\n\n首先，我需要检查页面1上是否有图元。我可以尝试列出页面，但刚才已经列出过，只看到页面1。不过，我无法列出页面上的widget。也许我需要向用户询问widget ID。\n\n另外，背景图设置：用户说\"放个背景图\"，可能是指为页面2设置背景图片。我可以使用create_page时的background参数，或者用manage_graphics的set_widget_style来设置背景。但set_widget_style是针对widget的，不是针对页面背景。\n\n实际上，create_page有background参数，可以设置背景颜色。如果要设置图片背景，可能需要用其他方式，比如创建一个大的矩形作为背景。但用户说\"背景图\"，可能是指图片。\n\n我需要先了解页面1上有什么widget。但当前工具没有列出widget的功能。也许我可以假设用户希望我创建一个新widget在页面2上，而不是移动现有的。或者，用户可能认为页面1上有一个默认的widget，比如温度计。\n\n让我先询问用户具体信息。但既然已经进入ASK_USER阶段，我应该主动提问。\n\n我会这样回复：询问widget的具体信息和背景图要求。同时，我可以先为页面2创建一个背景色，之后再修改。\n\n先创建页面2时，background默认是#FFFFFF。我可以修改它吗？create_page没有修改背景的功能。但可以用set_widget_style设置页面背景吗？set_widget_style是针对widget的，不是页面。\n\n也许manage_graphics的create_rect可以创建一个大矩形作为背景。但需要先创建widget。\n\n最好先询问用户。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 29000, "output_tokens": 1777, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 68004.39069999993}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "9f3bd22b-e416-4d1a-9204-a696a35907bc", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-024", "text": "建一个trend page，加个trend chart绑定历史数据", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "multi"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T09:07:50.650Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T09:08:36.771Z", "total_turns": 3, "terminal_state": "ASK_USER", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T09:07:50.651Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T09:08:19.375Z"}, {"name": "ASK_USER", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T09:08:19.375Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T09:08:36.771Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "pages": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.3944999991508666, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.1415999979362823, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [], "visible_count": 0, "selected": "workflow:handlers.validate_project", "action": null, "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.004800000169780105, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 960, "output_tokens": 291, "latency_ms": 9655.04090000104, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮你创建 trend page 并绑定历史数据。首先，我需要了解当前项目中已有的页面和数据点情况。", "reasoning": "The user wants to create a trend page with a trend chart that binds to historical data. Let me analyze the current situation:\n\n1. Current workflow: PointBinding, step=list_targets\n2. Current available tools: manage_pages (list_pages only), manage_points (list_points only)\n3. User wants to: \n   - Create a new page called \"trend\"\n   - Add a trend chart widget\n   - Bind it to historical data points\n\nTo accomplish this, I need to:\n1. First, list existing pages to understand the current state\n2. List existing points to see what historical data points are available\n\nHowever, the current available actions for manage_pages is only \"list_pages\" - I cannot create pages or add widgets with the current tool configuration. Similarly, manage_points only has \"list_points\".\n\nLet me first gather information by listing pages and points, then I'll need to explain to the user that to actually create the page and bind widgets, we need to switch to a different phase/tool configuration.\n\nLet me start by listing what we have."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 7799, "output_tokens": 564, "latency_ms": 19047.27500000081, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "当前项目状态：\n\n| 项目 | 数量 |\n|------|------|\n| 现有页面 | 0 个 |\n| 现有数据点 | 0 个 |\n\n**问题：** 目前项目中还没有定义任何 SCADA 数据点（tags），无法直接绑定历史趋势。\n\n要创建完整的 trend page，需要以下步骤：\n\n1. **创建数据点 (Points)** - 定义需要监控的历史数据标签（如温度、压力等）\n2. **创建页面 (Page)** - 新建 HMI 页面\n3. **添加趋势组件 (Trend Widget)** - 在页面上放置趋势曲线图表\n4. **绑定数据点** - 将数据点连接到趋势组件\n\n---\n\n**请确认以下信息：**\n\n1. 你想监控哪些工艺参数？例如：\n   - `Temperature_01` (温度, analog, °C)\n   - `Pressure_01` (压力, analog, bar)\n   - `FlowRate_01` (流量, analog, m³/h)\n\n2. 页面命名偏好？例如：\n   - 页面 ID: `trend_page`\n   - 页面名称: `历史趋势监控`\n\n3. 是否需要配置历史数据采集？（采样间隔、保留时长等）\n\nnext_state: ASK_USER", "reasoning": "The results show:\n1. No pages exist yet\n2. No points exist yet\n\nThis means I need to help the user:\n1. Create historical data points first\n2. Create the trend page\n3. Add a trend chart widget\n4. Bind the trend chart to the historical points\n\nHowever, looking at my current available tools, I can only:\n- manage_pages: list_pages\n- manage_points: list_points\n\nI cannot create pages or points with the current tool configuration. The workflow is at step=list_targets, and the available tools are very limited.\n\nI need to inform the user about the current state and guide them to the next steps. To fully accomplish what they want, we need to:\n1. First create some SCADA points (data tags) - this would require create_point capability\n2. Create the page - this would require create_page capability\n3. Add a trend widget - this would require create_widget capability\n4. Configure the trend - this would require trend-related tools\n5. Bind the points to the widget\n\nSince the current toolset doesn't support these operations, I should explain what needs to be done and suggest switching to the appropriate phase. Looking at the available next states: ASK_USER, VALIDATE\n\nActually, wait - I should clarify with the user what specific historical data points they want to bind to the trend chart, since there are currently no points defined."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 8360, "output_tokens": 509, "latency_ms": 17379.795299999387, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "好的，我现在处于 **ASK_USER** 阶段。当前工具仅支持查询操作，无法直接创建资源。\n\n为了后续能帮你创建 trend page 并绑定历史数据，请提供以下信息：\n\n---\n\n**📋 需要确认的信息：**\n\n**1. 数据点 (SCADA Points)**\n你想在趋势图上显示哪些变量？请列出：\n- 点位名称（Tag）\n- 类型（analog / digital / string）\n- 单位（如 °C, bar, %）\n- 量程范围（min ~ max）\n\n**2. 页面信息**\n- 页面 ID（如 `trend_page`）\n- 页面显示名称（如 `历史趋势监控`）\n\n**3. 趋势图配置**\n- 采样间隔（如 1秒、5秒）\n- 历史回看时长（如 1小时、24小时）\n\n---\n\n**💡 示例回复：**\n\n> 创建3个模拟量点位：\n> - Reactor_Temp: analog, °C, 0~200\n> - Reactor_Pressure: analog, bar, 0~10\n> - Pump_Flow: analog, m³/h, 0~100\n> \n> 页面：trend_page / 反应釜趋势监控\n> 采样：5秒间隔，回看24小时\n\n请告诉我你的具体需求，我将在下一阶段为你完成配置。", "reasoning": "The user is reminding me that I'm in the ASK_USER phase and should use current available tools to continue. However, looking at the current available tools:\n\n- manage_pages: only \"list_pages\" action\n- manage_points: only \"list_points\" action\n\nI cannot create pages or points with these limited actions. I already listed the pages and points, and there are none.\n\nThe workflow is \"PointBinding\" with step \"list_targets\". This seems like a phase for gathering information, not for creating resources.\n\nSince I cannot create the trend page with the current tool configuration, I should:\n1. Clearly explain to the user what information I need to proceed\n2. Ask them what specific data points they want to create\n3. Once they provide the information, I may need to switch to a different phase (like VALIDATE or another phase) to actually create the resources\n\nLet me ask the user for the specific details needed to create the trend page and historical data binding."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 17119, "output_tokens": 1364, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 46120.461099999375}, "judge": null}
