建页面、点位并进行绑定。但当前工具集中没有创建页面或点位的工具。这可能意味着我需要切换到其他阶段来获得相应工具。\n\n根据可切换的下一阶段：BIND_POINTS, DEPLOY, DONE, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE。其中MANAGE_PAGES可能用于页面管理，但之前只有list_pages。BIND_POINTS可能用于点位绑定。DEPLOY用于部署。VALIDATE用于验证。\n\n我需要先验证项目，然后再考虑部署。但首先，我需要创建页面和点位。也许我需要切换到MANAGE_PAGES阶段来创建页面？但之前在那个阶段只有list_pages功能。或者切换到BIND_POINTS阶段？但绑定点位的前提是已经有点位和页面。\n\n看来当前工具集不完整。我需要先检查项目状态，然后决定下一步。调用show_deployment_status。"}, {"turn": 10, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4410, "output_tokens": 433, "latency_ms": 14751.4837000017, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "当前阶段（GENERATE_LAYOUT）的可用工具仅包含部署相关操作，无法创建新页面和点位。您需要创建反应釜监控方案，这需要先创建页面和点位配置。\n\n我将切换到页面管理阶段来尝试创建监控画面。\n\nnext_state: MANAGE_PAGES", "reasoning": "当前处于GENERATE_LAYOUT阶段，但可用工具只有deployment，这看起来不太对。根据阶段描述，GENERATE_LAYOUT应该有创建页面和布局的工具，但现在只有deployment工具。\n\n让我回顾一下：用户需求是创建反应釜综合监控方案，包括新建画面、建三个点位、绑定到画面元素、最后下发验证。\n\n现在的情况是：\n1. 当前阶段：GENERATE_LAYOUT\n2. 可用工具：只有deployment\n3. 用户需要创建页面和点位，但当前工具无法创建这些\n\n根据行为准则第5条：若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，可以在回复的纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换到可切换的下一阶段中的合适阶段。\n\n可切换的下一阶段包括：BIND_POINTS, DEPLOY, DONE, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\n要创建页面和点位，需要MANAGE_PAGES阶段。但之前尝试过MANAGE_PAGES阶段，那个阶段也只能列出页面，无法创建。这可能意味着系统设计上，在某个阶段才能创建页面。\n\n让我先检查一下是否有其他方式。也许需要先创建点位？但manage_points工具在当前阶段不可用。\n\n我需要切换到能够创建点位的阶段。查看可切换阶段，BIND_POINTS可能允许创建点位？或者CONFIG_POINT可能在之前的阶段？\n\n等等，我需要查看整个工作流上下文。用户要求的是完整的配置流程：创建画面、创建点位、绑定、验证部署。\n\n当前在GENERATE_LAYOUT阶段，但工具只有deployment。这可能是系统的一个限制。我应该切换到MANAGE_PAGES阶段，然后看看能否创建页面。\n\n或者，也许我需要先切换到其他阶段来创建点位？让我先切换到MANAGE_PAGES阶段试试。"}, {"turn": 11, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4878, "output_tokens": 476, "latency_ms": 16044.794700002967, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "当前处于MANAGE_PAGES阶段，可用工具包括：manage_pages、manage_history、deployment、manage_scripts、manage_points。\n\n用户需求是创建反应釜综合监控方案：新建画面，建三个点位（温度、压力、液位），绑到画面的罐子和仪表上，最后下发验证。\n\n当前项目状态：页面、点位、脚本都为空，部署状态为draft。\n\n我需要：\n1. 新建一个反应釜监控画面\n2. 创建三个点位：温度、压力、液位\n3. 将点位绑定到画面的罐子和仪表上\n4. 验证并部署\n\n但根据之前的尝试，manage_pages只有list_pages功能，无法创建页面。同样，manage_points只有list_points功能，无法创建点位。这些工具似乎只有查询功能，没有创建功能。\n\n这可能是系统设计如此：在当前阶段，我只能查看现有配置，而无法创建新配置。用户的需求需要创建新资源，但当前阶段的工具不支持创建操作。\n\n根据行为准则第5条：\"若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，你可以在回复的纯文本中包含 'next_state: 阶段名' 来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段\"。\n\n可切换的下一阶段包括：BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, VALIDATE。\n\n用户需要创建点位和页面，但这些功能可能在其他阶段。或许CONFIG_POINT阶段可以创建点位？但当前可切换阶段中没有CONFIG_POINT。或者MANAGE_PAGES阶段应该能创建页面，但工具只有list_pages。\n\n也许我需要先创建点位？但manage_points只有list_points。这可能意味着系统期望我使用其他方式或阶段来完成创建。\n\n让我再检查一下manage_points是否真的只有list_points功能。从之前的调用看，确实只有list_points。同样manage_pages只有list_pages。\n\n或许这些工具被设计为只读，创建功能在其他阶段。但当前可切换阶段中没有明显的创建阶段。\n\n让我尝试调用deployment的validate_project来看看项目状态。或许验证能提供更多信息。"}, {"turn": 12, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5420, "output_tokens": 1047, "latency_ms": 35149.713099999644, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "当前处于MANAGE_PAGES阶段，但可用工具仅支持查看现有页面（list_pages），无法创建新页面。同样，点位管理工具也仅支持查看现有点位（list_points），无法创建新点位。\n\n您需要创建反应釜综合监控方案，包括：\n1. 新建监控画面\n2. 创建温度、压力、液位三个点位\n3. 绑定点位到画面元素\n4. 部署验证\n\n**当前项目状态**：\n- 页面数量：0个\n- 点位数量：0个  \n- 项目验证：已通过（validated）\n- 部署状态：草稿（draft）\n\n由于当前阶段的工具无法创建页面和点位，我需要切换到能够进行点位绑定的阶段。虽然点位尚未创建，但BIND_POINTS阶段可能提供更多配置功能。\n\nnext_state: BIND_POINTS", "reasoning": "我需要分析用户的需求：用户要建一个反应釜综合监控方案，包括新建画面，建三个点位（温度、压力、液位），绑到画面的罐子和仪表上，最后下发验证。\n\n当前阶段是MANAGE_PAGES，可用工具包括：manage_pages, manage_history, deployment, manage_scripts, manage_points。但这些工具大部分只能列出信息，不能创建。用户的需求涉及创建页面、创建点位、绑定点位到画面元素，这些操作在当前阶段可能无法完成。\n\n根据行为准则第5条：若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，可以在回复的纯文本中包含 \"next_state: 阶段名\" 来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段。\n\n可切换的下一阶段包括：BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, VALIDATE。\n\n用户需要创建页面和点位，然后绑定。可能需要先切换到CONFIG_POINT阶段？但可切换阶段中没有CONFIG_POINT。有BIND_POINTS阶段，但绑定需要先有页面和点位。GENERATE_LAYOUT阶段可能用于生成布局，但之前尝试过，只能查看状态。\n\n也许我需要先创建点位？但manage_points只有list_points，不能创建。同样manage_pages只有list_pages。\n\n看来当前阶段确实无法创建页面和点位。我需要切换到能创建这些的阶段。但可切换阶段中没有明确的创建阶段。或许CONFIG_SCRIPT或CONFIG_ALARM？但用户需要的是页面和点位。\n\n让我先检查一下当前项目状态，然后决定如何切换。我已经验证了项目，状态是validated。现在我需要告知用户当前情况，并建议切换到合适阶段。\n\n我应该先向用户说明当前工具的限制，然后建议切换到BIND_POINTS阶段？但绑定需要先有页面和点位。也许GENERATE_LAYOUT阶段可以创建页面？之前尝试时，该阶段也只有deployment工具。\n\n看来系统可能不支持通过工具创建页面和点位，可能需要其他方式。但根据工作流，应该有创建页面和点位的阶段。可能我需要先切换到MANAGE_PAGES阶段，但该阶段只有list_pages。\n\n或许用户的需求需要多个步骤：先创建页面，再创建点位，然后绑定。但当前工具集不支持创建操作。\n\n让我先查看当前页面和点位数量，然后向用户说明情况。我已经知道页面和点位数量都是0。\n\n我将向用户说明当前阶段的工具限制，然后建议切换到BIND_POINTS阶段，尽管可能无法创建页面和点位，但也许该阶段有更多功能。\n\n或者，我可以尝试调用manage_pages和manage_points看看是否有其他操作可用？但根据之前的调用，只有list操作。\n\n让我再仔细查看工具定义：manage_pages只有list_pages，manage_points只有list_points，manage_history只有list_history，manage_scripts只有list_scripts。这些都只有list操作。\n\n因此，当前阶段确实无法创建任何内容。我需要切换到其他阶段。根据可切换阶段，BIND_POINTS可能用于绑定点位，但需要先有页面和点位。\n\n也许我应该直接切换到DEPLOY阶段进行部署？但用户需要先创建监控方案。\n\n我需要向用户说明当前系统限制，并建议下一步。我将先验证项目状态，然后说明情况。项目已经验证通过，状态是validated。\n\n现在，我将回复用户，说明当前工具只能查看，无法创建页面和点位，建议切换到BIND_POINTS阶段尝试绑定操作，或者可能需要其他方式创建页面和点位。\n\n根据行为准则，我可以在回复中包含next_state来切换阶段。我将建议切换到BIND_POINTS阶段。\n\n但用户需求是创建页面和点位，绑定只是其中一步。也许GENERATE_LAYOUT阶段可以创建布局？之前尝试时只有deployment工具。\n\n让我再尝试一次GENERATE_LAYOUT阶段，看看是否有其他工具可用。或者直接切换到BIND_POINTS。\n\n我决定先切换到BIND_POINTS阶段，看看是否有创建或绑定功能。如果不行，再尝试其他阶段。\n\n我将回复用户，说明当前情况，并切换到BIND_POINTS阶段。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "DeploymentCheck"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 37074, "output_tokens": 4702, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 171047.1491999997}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "0bbbb158-d47b-4a8c-bec3-161cfdb098c2", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-025", "text": "建一个反应釜综合监控方案：新建画面，建三个点位（温度、压力、液位），绑到画面的罐子和仪表上，最后下发验证", "complexity": "complex", "domain": "multi"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T09:11:32.711Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T09:13:30.040Z", "total_turns": 5, "terminal_state": "UNKNOWN", "early_terminated": true, "termination_reason": "no finish() call"}, "states": [{"name": "VALIDATE", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T09:11:32.711Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T09:11:59.950Z"}, {"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T09:11:59.950Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T09:13:03.484Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_POINT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T09:13:03.484Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T09:13:30.040Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["show_deployment_status", "validate_project"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 5, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.3508000010915566, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["show_deployment_status", "validate_project"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 5, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "pages": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.1986000026809052, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 3, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["deploy_project", "show_deployment_status", "validate_project", "rollback_deployment"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "deployment", "action": "validate_project", "args": {"action": "validate_project"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"deployment_id": "default", "errors": [], "status": "validated"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"deployments.default": {"id": "default", "target": "default", "status": "validated", "validation_errors": [], "notes": ""}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 1.3303999985510018, "intended_entities": ["deployments.default"], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 5, "state": "CONFIG_POINT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["deploy_project", "show_deployment_status", "validate_project", "rollback_deployment"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "create_point", "args": {"action": "create_point", "point_id": "T_REACTOR_TEMP", "point_type": "AI", "description": "反应釜温度", "eng_unit": "℃", "range_low": "0", "range_high": "300"}, "schema_valid": false, "result_ok": false, "error_code": "SCHEMA_ERROR", "error_msg": "create_point.tag: Field required; create_point.type: Field required", "result_data": {}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.3421999974525534, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 5, "state": "CONFIG_POINT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["deploy_project", "show_deployment_status", "validate_project", "rollback_deployment"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "create_point", "args": {"action": "create_point", "point_id": "P_REACTOR_PRESS", "point_type": "AI", "description": "反应釜压力", "eng_unit": "MPa", "range_low": "0", "range_high": "1.6"}, "schema_valid": false, "result_ok": false, "error_code": "SCHEMA_ERROR", "error_msg": "create_point.tag: Field required; create_point.type: Field required", "result_data": {}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.9790999974939041, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 5, "state": "CONFIG_POINT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["deploy_project", "show_deployment_status", "validate_project", "rollback_deployment"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "create_point", "args": {"action": "create_point", "point_id": "L_REACTOR_LEVEL", "point_type": "AI", "description": "反应釜液位", "eng_unit": "%", "range_low": "0", "range_high": "100"}, "schema_valid": false, "result_ok": false, "error_code": "SCHEMA_ERROR", "error_msg": "create_point.tag: Field required; create_point.type: Field required", "result_data": {}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.9626000028220005, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": null, "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1635, "output_tokens": 697, "latency_ms": 22855.473399999028, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来分析一下您的需求。您想要创建一个完整的反应釜监控方案，包括：\n\n1. **新建 HMI 画面** - 用于展示反应釜监控界面\n2. **新建三个点位** - 温度（温度传感器）、压力（压力传感器）、液位（液位传感器）\n3. **绑定点位到画面控件** - 将点位绑定到罐子和仪表组件上\n4. **下发验证** - 部署项目并进行校验\n\n但是，当前处于 **VALIDATE（验证）阶段**，此阶段的工具权限是**只读**的：\n\n| 工具 | 当前允许的操作 | 您需要的操作 |\n|------|--------------|-------------|\n| manage_pages | 仅 `list_pages`（查看） | ❌ 需要**创建**页面和控件 |\n| manage_points | 仅 `list_points`（查看） | ❌ 需要**创建**点位 |\n| deployment | `validate_project`、`show_deployment_status` | ✅ 可用于最终验证 |\n\n我需要切换到 **ANALYZE_INTENT 阶段**，在那里可以进行点位创建、页面管理和配置绑定等写操作。\n\n让我先切换阶段：", "reasoning": "The user wants to create a comprehensive reactor monitoring solution. Let me break down their requirements:\n\n1. Create a new HMI page (画面)\n2. Create three points: temperature, pressure, level (温度、压力、液位)\n3. Bind these points to widgets on the page (tanks and instruments)\n4. Deploy and validate\n\nHowever, looking at the current stage and available tools:\n- Current stage: VALIDATE\n- Available tools: Only read/query operations are allowed\n  - manage_pages: only `list_pages`\n  - manage_history: only `list_history`\n  - deployment: `show_deployment_status`, `validate_project`\n  - manage_scripts: only `list_scripts`\n  - manage_points: only `list_points`\n\nThe user is asking me to:\n1. **Create** a new page - but `manage_pages` only allows `list_pages` action\n2. **Create** three points - but `manage_points` only allows `list_points` action\n3. **Bind** points to widgets - this would require write operations on pages\n4. **Deploy** and validate - `deployment` has `validate_project` available\n\nI cannot perform create/update operations in the VALIDATE stage. The current stage only supports read/query operations.\n\nAccording to my behavior guidelines:\n- \"若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，你可以在回复的纯文本中包含 \"next_state: 阶段名\" 来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段\"\n- Available next states: ANALYZE_INTENT, DEPLOY, DONE\n\nThe appropriate next stage would be ANALYZE_INTENT, which should allow me to analyze the user's intent and potentially have access to create/write operations.\n\nLet me explain this to the user and switch to the ANALYZE_INTENT stage where I can properly handle their request."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1927, "output_tokens": 131, "latency_ms": 4367.641900000308, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "好的，确认当前项目是空的：\n- 📊 **点位数量**：0 个\n- 📄 **页面数量**：0 个\n\n现在我需要切换到 **ANALYZE_INTENT 阶段**，该阶段可以执行创建点位、创建页面、配置控件和绑定点位等写操作，才能完成您的需求。\n\nnext_state: ANALYZE_INTENT", "reasoning": "Good, I confirmed that there are currently no points and no pages in the project. Now I need to switch to the ANALYZE_INTENT stage to be able to create points and pages."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2112, "output_tokens": 1378, "latency_ms": 47916.62329999963, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我现在进入 **ANALYZE_INTENT 阶段**，来分析您的反应釜综合监控方案需求：\n\n---\n\n## 📋 意图分析\n\n| 序号 | 任务 | 所需工具 | 当前状态 |\n|------|------|---------|---------|\n| 1 | 创建三个点位（温度、压力、液位） | `manage_points` → `create_point` | ⏳ 待执行 |\n| 2 | 新建 HMI 画面 | `manage_pages` → `create_page` | ⏳ 待执行 |\n| 3 | 在画面上添加罐子和仪表控件 | `manage_pages` → `add_widget` | ⏳ 待执行 |\n| 4 | 将点位绑定到控件 | `bind_points` | ⏳ 待执行 |\n| 5 | 校验项目 | `deployment` → `validate_project` | ⏳ 待执行 |\n| 6 | 下装部署 | `deployment` → `deploy_project` | ⏳ 待执行 |\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 执行计划\n\n**第一步：创建点位**\n- `T_REACTOR_TEMP` - 反应釜温度，模拟量，量程 0~300°C，单位 ℃\n- `P_REACTOR_PRESS` - 反应釜压力，模拟量，量程 0~1.6MPa，单位 MPa\n- `L_REACTOR_LEVEL` - 反应釜液位，模拟量，量程 0~100%，单位 %\n\n**第二步：创建画面**\n- 页面名称：`反应釜综合监控`\n- 添加设备图形：储罐控件、温度表、压力表、液位计\n\n**第三步：绑定点位**\n- 温度 → 温度表控件\n- 压力 → 压力表控件\n- 液位 → 储罐/液位计控件\n\n**第四步：校验 & 下装**\n\n---\n\n当前阶段的可用工具中，我确认可以执行 **校验** 和 **下装**，但需要确认是否有创建点位和页面的工具权限。让我先尝试校验当前项目状态，确认环境就绪：", "reasoning": "The user has confirmed I'm now in the ANALYZE_INTENT stage. Let me check what tools are available in this stage. Based on the system prompt, I need to analyze the user's intent and determine which tools to use.\n\nThe user wants to:\n1. Create a new HMI page\n2. Create three points (temperature, pressure, level)\n3. Bind points to widgets on the page\n4. Deploy and validate\n\nIn the ANALYZE_INTENT stage, I should analyze the intent and determine what tools/actions are needed. But I need to see what tools are actually available to me now. The system prompt says \"当前可用工具\" will be listed, but I only see the same deployment tool listed.\n\nWait, looking at the original system prompt again - it only lists deployment as the available tool for the VALIDATE stage. Now I'm in ANALYZE_INTENT, so I should have different tools available. But the tools section still shows the same deployment tool.\n\nLet me reconsider - the tools available to me are defined by the system, and I only have the `deployment` tool available based on what's provided. In the ANALYZE_INTENT stage, I should be able to access tools like:\n- manage_pages (for creating pages, adding widgets)\n- manage_points (for creating points)\n- bind_points (for binding points to widgets)\n\nBut these tools aren't actually defined in my available function list. I only have the `deployment` function available.\n\nGiven this limitation, I should:\n1. Acknowledge the user's request\n2. Break down the intent analysis\n3. Explain what steps would be needed\n4. Note that I need the appropriate tools to be available\n\nActually, wait - let me re-read the prompt. It says the user confirmed I'm in ANALYZE_INTENT and to use \"当前可用工具\". Perhaps in this stage, the tools should be different but they're not showing up in my function definitions.\n\nI think I need to work with what I have. The only tool I have is `deployment`. Let me think about what I can do:\n\n1. I can validate the project using `validate_project`\n2. I can show deployment status using `show_deployment_status`\n\n\n3. I can deploy using `deploy_project`\n4. I can rollback using `rollback_deployment`\n\nThese don't help me create pages, points, or bindings. In the ANALYZE_INTENT stage, I need to identify the tools required for this workflow and potentially switch to the appropriate stage where those tools are available. The user has confirmed I'm in ANALYZE_INTENT and wants me to proceed, but I'm limited by the available tools—I should analyze the intent and determine what additional capabilities are needed to complete the task.\n\nTo fulfill this request, I'd need manage_points to create temperature, pressure, and level points; manage_pages to build the HMI page with widgets; bind_points to connect points to the interface; and deployment tools for validation and deployment. Since only the deployment tool is currently available, I need to check whether other tools exist in this stage. Let me call the deployment validate action to understand the current project state, then identify what stage transitions are necessary to access the tools I need. The user wants me to proceed with the task, but I only have access to the `deployment` tool in the current function definitions. I need to identify what capabilities are missing to complete the workflow—specifically, I'd need tools for creating points, building HMI pages with widgets, and binding those points to interface elements. Since I can't directly execute these operations, I should outline the analysis and confirm what steps the user expects me to take given these constraints. I should attempt to call the manage_points and manage_pages tools since the system indicates these capabilities exist in the current stage, even if they're not explicitly defined in the available functions. The stage-based tool restriction suggests I have access to more than what's listed, so let me try invoking these tools to see if they're actually available. I'll be direct with the user about what I can actually accomplish—acknowledging the full scope of what they need while being clear about which parts I can handle now and which require additional tool availability."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3558, "output_tokens": 528, "latency_ms": 15604.330000001937, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "好的，我已确认当前环境。项目校验通过，但项目内容为空，我需要逐步创建。\n\n**当前阶段的可用工具**主要是 `deployment` 相关操作，**无法直接创建点位和页面**。\n\n根据您的需求，我需要依次切换到以下阶段完成任务：\n\n| 步骤 | 需要切换到的阶段 | 目的 |\n|------|-----------------|------|\n| ① | **CONFIG_POINT** | 创建温度、压力、液位三个点位 |\n| ② | **MANAGE_PAGES** | 新建画面、添加罐子和仪表控件 |\n| ③ | **BIND_POINTS** | 将点位绑定到画面控件 |\n| ④ | **VALIDATE / DEPLOY** | 校验并下装 |\n\n我现在开始第一步，切换到 **CONFIG_POINT** 阶段来创建三个点位：\n\nnext_state: CONFIG_POINT", "reasoning": "The user is telling me I'm in the ANALYZE_INTENT stage. But looking at the current available tools, I only have the `deployment` tool available. I don't have access to tools like:\n- `manage_points` (for creating points)\n- `manage_pages` (for creating pages and adding widgets)\n- `bind_points` (for binding points to widgets)\n\nThe user wants me to:\n1. Create 3 points (temperature, pressure, level)\n2. Create a new HMI page\n3. Add widgets (tank, instruments) to the page\n4. Bind points to widgets\n5. Validate and deploy\n\nBut I don't have the tools to do steps 1-4. The system prompt says:\n- \"若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，你可以在回复的纯文本中包含 \"next_state: 阶段名\" 来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段\"\n\nLooking at the available next states: ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\nSo I should switch to the appropriate stages:\n1. CONFIG_POINT - for creating points\n2. MANAGE_PAGES - for creating pages and adding widgets\n3. BIND_POINTS - for binding points to widgets\n\nI should switch to CONFIG_POINT first to create the points. Let me do that.\n\nActually, I should explain to the user what I need to do and then switch to the appropriate stage. Let me switch to CONFIG_POINT first."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4101, "output_tokens": 573, "latency_ms": 14199.377200002345, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我现在进入 **CONFIG_POINT** 阶段，开始创建反应釜监控的三个点位。\n\n让我为您创建温度、压力、液位三个过程点位：", "reasoning": "用户确认我已进入 CONFIG_POINT 阶段。现在我需要查看当前可用的工具来创建点位。\n\n根据系统提示，当前阶段是 CONFIG_POINT，我需要使用这个阶段的可用工具来创建三个点位：\n1. 温度点位 (T_REACTOR_TEMP)\n2. 压力点位 (P_REACTOR_PRESS)\n3. 液位点位 (L_REACTOR_LEVEL)\n\n但是我需要先看看当前阶段有哪些可用工具。根据之前的上下文，工具列表中