"schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.004699999408330768, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": null, "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 967, "output_tokens": 213, "latency_ms": 10293.773699999292, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想要创建一个泵站控制台，包含启停控制功能，并且要配置报警。当前阶段是ANALYZE_INTENT，工作流上下文是AlarmConfig，步骤是discover_points。\n\n首先，我需要理解用户的需求：\n1. 泵站控制台 - 这涉及到创建HMI页面\n2. 启停控制 - 需要有控制按钮和相关点位\n3. 报警配置 - 需要设置报警点\n\n但目前的工具限制是：manage_points只允许list_points操作，manage_pages只允许list_pages操作。我无法直接创建点位或页面。这意味着我需要先了解现有的点位和页面情况，然后可能需要切换到其他阶段来完成实际配置。\n\n让我先查看现有的点位和页面情况。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 967, "output_tokens": 213, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 23262.495700000727}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "4049a17c-489c-4b9b-ac24-15abc10aeda3", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-029", "text": "复制车间一的页面到车间二，替换其中所有的'WS1'点位标签为'WS2'，然后做下装前校验", "complexity": "complex", "domain": "multi"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T09:23:37.918Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T09:25:33.315Z", "total_turns": 7, "terminal_state": "DONE", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "VALIDATE", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T09:23:37.918Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T09:24:12.889Z"}, {"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T09:24:12.889Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T09:24:34.664Z"}, {"name": "MANAGE_PAGES", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T09:24:34.664Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T09:25:10.138Z"}, {"name": "VALIDATE", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T09:25:10.138Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T09:25:33.315Z"}, {"name": "DONE", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T09:25:33.315Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T09:25:33.315Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["show_deployment_status", "validate_project"]}, {"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}], "visible_count": 5, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "pages": [{"id": "ws1", "name": "车间一"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.3584999978775159, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["show_deployment_status", "validate_project"]}, {"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}], "visible_count": 5, "selected": "deployment", "action": "show_deployment_status", "args": {"action": "show_deployment_status"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"deployment_id": "default", "status": "draft", "errors": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.0966999980155379, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": ["deployments.default"]}, {"turn": 4, "state": "MANAGE_PAGES", "visible_tools": [{"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["deploy_project", "show_deployment_status", "validate_project", "rollback_deployment"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "deployment", "action": "show_deployment_status", "args": {"action": "show_deployment_status"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"deployment_id": "default", "status": "draft", "errors": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.3531999975384679, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": ["deployments.default"]}, {"turn": 6, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [{"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["deploy_project", "show_deployment_status", "validate_project", "rollback_deployment"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "deployment", "action": "validate_project", "args": {"action": "validate_project", "deployment_id": "default", "target": "default"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"deployment_id": "default", "errors": [], "status": "validated"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"deployments.default": {"id": "default", "target": "default", "status": "validated", "validation_errors": [], "notes": ""}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 1.3254999976197723, "intended_entities": ["deployments.default"], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:a8b38ccbde7608389b905237a2c359bf6459a8a493f163a10a476a380590948e", "final_hash": "sha256:f4c1b6d5cc89f00171093fd26daf8088fe4803a78b0922514df6e54a6ca08699", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1631, "output_tokens": 500, "latency_ms": 13780.20209999886, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来分析一下您的需求：\n\n1. **复制页面**：将\"车间一\"页面复制为\"车间二\"\n2. **替换点位标签**：将所有'WS1'替换为'WS2'\n3. **下装前校验**：运行项目校验\n\n首先，我需要查看当前项目的页面情况，同时了解一下当前的部署状态。让我先调用查询工具：", "reasoning": "The user is asking me to:\n1. Copy a page called \"车间一\" (Workshop 1) to \"车间二\" (Workshop 2)\n2. Replace all 'WS1' point tags with 'WS2' in the copied page\n3. Run a pre-deployment validation\n\nHowever, I need to check what tools are available to me in the current VALIDATE stage:\n\n1. `manage_pages` - only allows `list_pages` action (read-only)\n2. `deployment` - allows `show_deployment_status` and `validate_project`\n3. `manage_history` - only allows `list_history`\n4. `manage_points` - only allows `list_points`\n5. `manage_scripts` - only allows `list_scripts`\n\nLooking at the available tools and their allowed actions, I don't have the capability to:\n- Create/copy pages\n- Modify widget bindings (replace point tags)\n\nThe `manage_pages` tool description says it handles \"HMI page & widget management, including point↔widget binding\" but in the current VALIDATE stage, it only allows the `list_pages` action.\n\nFor the validation part, I can use `deployment` with action `validate_project`.\n\nLet me first:\n1. List the pages to see what's available\n2. Explain that the copy/modify operations are not available in the current VALIDATE stage\n3. Proceed with the validation that IS available\n\nActually, I should first try to understand the current state by listing pages, and then explain to the user that the page copy and point replacement operations are not available in the current VALIDATE stage - they would need to be done in a different stage (like ANALYZE_INTENT or another configuration stage).\n\nLet me list the pages first to understand the project structure."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1747, "output_tokens": 703, "latency_ms": 21177.82680000164, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我已了解当前情况：\n\n- **现有页面**：车间一 (id: ws1)\n- **部署状态**：草稿状态 (draft)\n\n---\n\n⚠️ **重要说明**：\n\n在当前 **VALIDATE（校验）** 阶段，我的工具权限受到限制：\n\n| 操作 | 是否可用 | 说明 |\n|------|----------|------|\n| 查看页面列表 | ✅ | 已完成 |\n| 复制/创建页面 | ❌ | 当前阶段仅允许只读操作 |\n| 修改点位绑定（WS1→WS2替换） | ❌ | 当前阶段仅允许只读操作 |\n| 项目校验 | ✅ | 可以执行 |\n\n**页面复制和点位替换属于配置操作**，需要在配置阶段完成。建议先切换到 **ANALYZE_INTENT** 阶段来执行页面复制和点位替换，完成后再返回 VALIDATE 阶段执行下装前校验。\n\n---\n\n是否要我切换到 ANALYZE_INTENT 阶段来完成页面复制和点位替换？切换后流程大致如下：\n\n1. 🔄 **复制页面**：基于\"车间一\"创建\"车间二\"\n2. 🔁 **替换点位**：将新页面中所有 `WS1` 绑定替换为 `WS2`\n3. ✅ **回到 VALIDATE 阶段**：执行下装前校验\n\n请确认是否继续？\n\nnext_state: ANALYZE_INTENT", "reasoning": "So I can see:\n1. There's currently 1 page: \"车间一\" (id: ws1)\n2. The deployment status is \"draft\" with no errors\n\nNow, the user wants to:\n1. Copy page \"车间一\" to create \"车间二\"\n2. Replace all WS1 point tags with WS2\n3. Run validation\n\nHowever, in the current VALIDATE stage, the `manage_pages` tool only allows `list_pages` action (read-only). I cannot:\n- Create a new page\n- Copy a page\n- Modify widget bindings\n\nI need to inform the user that these operations are not available in the current VALIDATE stage. The page creation and modification would need to be done in a different stage (likely ANALYZE_INTENT or a configuration stage).\n\nI should explain this limitation and suggest switching to the ANALYZE_INTENT stage to perform the page copy and point replacement operations first, then come back to VALIDATE to run the validation.\n\nActually, looking at the stage transitions:\n- Current stage: VALIDATE\n- Next states available: ANALYZE_INTENT, DEPLOY, DONE\n\nThe ANALYZE_INTENT stage might have more tools available for page management and point binding. Let me suggest switching to that stage.\n\nWait, but I can only switch states if the current stage's tools don't satisfy the user's needs. Since the current stage doesn't have the tools to copy pages and modify bindings, I should suggest switching to ANALYZE_INTENT.\n\nHowever, I should note that the user's request has two parts:\n1. Page copy and modification (not available in VALIDATE stage)\n2. Validation (available in VALIDATE stage)\n\nI should explain that I need to switch to ANALYZE_INTENT first to handle the page operations, then come back to VALIDATE for the validation."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2504, "output_tokens": 780, "latency_ms": 21769.764799999393, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "好的，我现在处于 **ANALYZE_INTENT（意图分析）** 阶段。让我分析您的需求并确定需要调用的工具和工作流程。\n\n---\n\n## 📋 需求分析\n\n| 步骤 | 操作 | 目标阶段 | 状态 |\n|------|------|----------|------|\n| 1 | 复制\"车间一\"页面为\"车间二\" | **MANAGE_PAGES** | ⏳ 待执行 |\n| 2 | 替换所有 `WS1` 点位标签为 `WS2` | **BIND_POINTS** | ⏳ 待执行 |\n| 3 | 下装前校验 | **VALIDATE** | ⏳ 待执行 |\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 当前阶段能力评估\n\n当前 ANALYZE_INTENT 阶段的可用工具仅限于 `deployment`（部署相关），**无法直接执行页面复制和点位替换**。\n\n但我已识别出正确的执行路径：\n\n```\nMANAGE_PAGES → 复制页面\"车间一\"为\"车间二\"\n       ↓\nBIND_POINTS  → 将新页面中 WS1 绑定替换为 WS2\n       ↓\nVALIDATE     → 执行下装前校验\n```\n\n---\n\n## ⏭️ 建议下一步\n\n我需要切换到 **MANAGE_PAGES** 阶段来执行页面复制操作。\n\nnext_state: MANAGE_PAGES", "reasoning": "The user has confirmed I'm now in the ANALYZE_INTENT stage. However, I need to check what tools are available in this stage. Looking at my system prompt, it says:\n\n【当前阶段】ANALYZE_INTENT\n【当前可用工具】(仅以下工具可被调用)\n- deployment: Project validation, deployment, rollback, status.; 当前允许 actions: deploy_project, show_deployment_status, validate_project, rollback_deployment\n\nIt seems like even in the ANALYZE_INTENT stage, I only have access to the `deployment` tool. This is the same as before - I don't have tools for managing pages or binding points.\n\nLet me re-read the system prompt more carefully... The available tools listed are still only `deployment`. This means I cannot perform page copy or point replacement operations even in the ANALYZE_INTENT stage.\n\nIn this case, I should:\n1. Acknowledge that even in this stage, I don't have the necessary tools for page management and point binding\n2. Offer to perform what I CAN do - the validation\n3. Explain that the page copy and point replacement operations would need to be done through a different interface or by someone with appropriate access\n\nActually, let me re-read the stage transitions again:\n【可切换的下一阶段】ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\nI can see MANAGE_PAGES and BIND_POINTS are available as next stages! These are the stages I need for:\n- MANAGE_PAGES: for copying/creating pages\n- BIND_POINTS: for replacing point bindings\n\nSo I should suggest switching to MANAGE_PAGES first to handle the page copy, then BIND_POINTS for the point replacement, and finally back to VALIDATE for the validation.\n\nBut wait - the user said I've entered ANALYZE_INTENT. The current available tools show only `deployment`. So in this stage, I should analyze the intent and determine which next stages to transition to.\n\n\nSince the page management and binding tools aren't accessible here, I need to recommend transitioning to MANAGE_PAGES to create the duplicate page, then BIND_POINTS to update the point references, before returning to VALIDATE for the final validation check."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3297, "output_tokens": 598, "latency_ms": 17093.837899999926, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我现在处于 **MANAGE_PAGES（页面管理）** 阶段。让我先查看当前项目的页面情况：", "reasoning": "The user has confirmed I'm now in the MANAGE_PAGES stage. Let me check what tools are available in this stage.\n\nLooking at my system prompt, it shows:\n【当前阶段】MANAGE_PAGES\n【当前可用工具】(仅以下工具可被调用)\n- deployment: Project validation, deployment, rollback, status.; 当前允许 actions: deploy_project, show_deployment_status, validate_project, rollback_deployment\n\nHmm, it still shows only the `deployment` tool. But wait, the MANAGE_PAGES stage should have page management tools. Let me re-read the available functions...\n\nThe functions available to me are:\n1. deployment - Project validation, deployment, rollback, status\n\nThat's it. Even though I'm in MANAGE_PAGES stage, I still only have access to the deployment tool. \n\nThis is a bit confusing. The system says I'm in MANAGE_PAGES stage but the available tools don't include page management tools. \n\nLooking at the tool descriptions again:\n- deployment: currently allows actions: deploy_project, show_deployment_status, validate_project, rollback_deployment\n\nWait, I think I need to look at this differently. The system prompt at the top says:\n【当前阶段】MANAGE_PAGES\n【可切换的下一阶段】BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, VALIDATE\n【当前可用工具】(仅以下工具可被调用)\n- deployment: ...\n\nSo even in MANAGE_PAGES stage, I only have the deployment tool available. This seems like a limitation of the current system configuration.\n\nIn this case, I should:\n1. Acknowledge the limitation\n2. Try to use what's available - but deployment doesn't help with page management\n3. Explain that the MANAGE_PAGES stage doesn't have the expected page management tools available\n\nActually, wait. Let me re-read the entire prompt more carefully. \n\nThe available functions defined are only `deployment`. So regardless of what stage I'm in, I can only call the deployment tool. This appears to be a system configuration issue where the page management tools aren't available in the current environment. I should inform the user about this limitation and suggest either: (1) the page copy needs to be done manually outside this tool, (2) there's a configuration issue, or (3) we should proceed with what we CAN do (validation) and note that page operations need separate handling.\n\nSince I can't actually copy pages or modify bindings with the available tools, I should be transparent about this limitation and ask if they want me to proceed with validation only, or if the page operations have already been completed elsewhere."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3962, "output_tokens": 567, "latency_ms": 18368.608999997377, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我理解您希望我继续执行任务，但我需要向您坦诚说明当前的情况：\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 工具限制说明\n\n当前 **MANAGE_PAGES** 阶段中，我可用的工具仅有：\n\n| 工具 | 允许的操作 |\n|------|-----------|\n| `deployment` | `deploy_project`, `show_deployment_status`, `validate_project`, `rollback_deployment` |\n\n**我没有找到以下所需工具：**\n- ❌ `copy_page` — 复制页面\n- ❌ `create_page` — 创建页面\n- ❌ `modify_bindings` — 修改点位绑定（WS1→WS2）\n\n---\n\n## 🛠️ 建议方案\n\n由于当前环境未提供页面复制和点位替换的工具接口，有以下几种处理方式：\n\n1. **手动操作**：在 SCADA 配置界面中手动完成\"车间一\"页面的复制及点位替换后，我来执行下装前校验\n2. **确认已就绪**：如果页面复制和点位替换已在其他系统中完成，我可以直接跳转到 **VALIDATE** 阶段执行校验\n\n---\n\n请问您希望如何处理？\n\n- 如需我执行**校验**，请确认页面操作已完成，我将切换到 VALIDATE 阶段\n- 如有其他指示，请告知\n\nnext_state: VALIDATE", "reasoning": "The user is reminding me that I'm in the MANAGE_PAGES stage. Let me look at the available tools again carefully.\n\nLooking at the system prompt:\n【当前可用工具】(仅以下工具可被调用)\n- deployment: Project validation, deployment, rollback, status.; 当前允许 actions: deploy_project, show_deployment_status, validate_project, rollback_deployment\n\nThe only tool I have is `deployment`, and it only allows: deploy_project, show_deployment_status, validate_project, rollback_deployment.\n\nI don't have a `manage_pages` tool available to me, even though I'm in the MANAGE_PAGES stage. The function definitions only include `deployment`.\n\nI need to be honest with the user that in the current environment, I don't have the page management tools (like copy_page, create_page, modify_bindings, etc.) available. I can only work with the deployment tool.\n\nLet me inform the user clearly about this limitation and suggest alternatives:\n1. The page copy and point replacement may need to be done manually in the SCADA configuration interface\n2. Or there may be a system configuration issue where the page management tools aren't loaded\n3. I can still perform the validation step once the page operations are done\n\nI should be straightforward about what I can and cannot do."}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4541, "output_tokens": 207, "latency_ms": 7079.342100001668, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，现在我已进入 **VALIDATE（校验）** 阶段。接下来我将为您的项目执行下装前校验（validate_project）。", "reasoning": "The user has confirmed I'm now in the VALIDATE stage. Let me check what tools are available in this stage.\n\nLooking at the system prompt:\n【当前阶段】VALIDATE\n【当前可用工具】(仅以下工具可被调用)\n- deployment: Project validation, deployment, rollback, status.; 当前允许 actions: deploy_project, show_deployment_status, validate_project, rollback_deployment\n\nNow I'm in the VALIDATE stage and I can use the `deployment` tool with the `validate_project` action. This is what the user originally asked for - the pre-deployment validation.\n\nLet me execute the validation now."}, {"turn": 7, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4813, "output_tokens": 502, "latency_ms": 16084.937100000388, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "校验已执行完成！让我为您汇总本次任务的完整结果：\n\n---\n\n## ✅ 任务执行报告\n\n### 1. 页面复制 & 点位替换\n| 操作 | 状态 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 复制\"车间一\"→\"车间二\" | ⚠️ 未执行 | 当前工具环境未提供页面管理工具 |\n| 替换 `WS1` → `WS2` | ⚠️ 未执行 | 当前工具环境未提供点位绑定工具 |\n\n> 💡 **建议**：请在 SCADA 配置界面中手动完成上述页面操作\n\n---\n\n### 2. 下装前校验 ✅ 通过\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| 校验状态 | ✅ **validated**（已通过） |\n| 错误数量 | 0 |\n| 警告 | 无 |\n\n**当前项目已通过下装前校验，处于可下装状态。**\n\n---\n\n## 📋 后续可选操作\n\n| 操作 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| 🔵 执行下装 | 切换到 DEPLOY 阶段，将项目部署到生产环境 |\n| 🔴 回退草稿 | 如需修改，可回退到草稿状态 |\n| ✅ 完成任务 | 结束当前工作流 |\n\n如需执行下装或其他操作，请告知！\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "The user is reminding me again that I'm in the VALIDATE stage. I already ran the validation and it passed. Let me summarize the results and complete the task.\n\nThe validation result showed:\n- status: \"validated\"\n- errors: []\n- ok: true\n\nThis means the project passed validation successfully. I should inform the user of the results and mark the task as complete.\n\nSince the user originally had 3 requests:\n1. Copy page from 车间一 to 车间二 - Could not be done due to tool limitations\n2. Replace WS1 with WS2 - Could not be done due to tool limitations\n3. Pre-deployment validation - ✅ Completed successfully\n\nI should summarize the overall status and let the user know the validation passed, while noting that the page operations needed to be done manually. Then I should end the task with next_state: DONE."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "DeploymentCheck"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 22495, "output_tokens": 3857, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 115397.60810000007}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "b46fedb1-3674-47b3-8103-f1dcf57c4130", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-029", "text": "复制车间一的页面到车间二，替换其中所有的'WS1'点位标签为'WS2'，然后做下装前校验", "complexity": "complex", "domain": "multi"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T09:25:33.671Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T09:26:28.627Z", "total_turns": 4, "terminal_state": "DEPLOY", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "VALIDATE", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T09:25:33.671Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T09:25:44.678Z"}, {"name": "DEPLOY", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T09:25:44.678Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T09:26:28.627Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["show_deployment_status", "validate_project"]}, {"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}], "visible_count": 5, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "pages": [{"id": "ws1", "name": "车间一"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.4391999975487124, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "DEPLOY", "visible_tools": [{"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["deploy_project", "show_deployment_status", "validate_project", "rollback_deployment"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "deployment", "action": "show_deployment_status", "args": {"action": "show_deployment_status"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"deployment_id": "default", "status": "draft", "errors": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.3371999993978534, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": ["deployments.default"]}, {"turn": 3, "state": "DEPLOY", "visible_tools": [{"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["deploy_project", "show_deployment_status", "validate_project", "rollback_deployment"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "deployment", "action": "validate_project", "args": {"action": "validate_project"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"deployment_id": "default", "errors": [], "status": "validated"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"deployments.default": {"id": "default", "target": "default", "status": "validated", "validation_errors": [], "notes": ""}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 1.3269000010041054, "intended_entities": ["deployments.default"], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:a8b38ccbde7608389b905237a2c359bf6459a8a493f163a10a476a380590948e", "final_hash": "sha256:f4c1b6d5cc89f00171093fd26daf8088fe4803a78b0922514df6e54a6ca08699", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1631, "output_tokens": 233, "latency_ms": 10999.437500002387, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想要执行以下操作：\n1. 复制\"车间一\"页面到\"车间二\"\n2. 替换所有'WS1'点位标签为'WS2'\n3. 进行下装前校验\n\n当前阶段是VALIDATE，可用工具包括：\n- manage_pages（仅允许list_pages操作）\n- deployment（允许show_deployment_status和validate_project）\n- manage_history（允许list_history）\n- manage_points（允许list_points）\n- manage_scripts（允许list_scripts）\n\n首先，我需要了解当前有哪些页面，以便找到\"车间一\"页面。我可以调用manage_pages的list_pages操作。\n\n然后，关于复制页面和替换点位标签的操作，manage_pages目前只允许list_pages，不允许其他操作（如创建、更新、复制）。这可能意味着我无法直接执行复制和替换操作。不过，我可以先列出页面，了解当前情况。\n\n对于下装前校验，我可以使用deployment工具的validate_project操作。\n\n让我先列出页面。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1458, "output_tokens": 280, "latency_ms": 12056.464199999027, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "当前阶段已切换到DEPLOY。可用工具只有deployment，可以执行deploy_project、show_deployment_status、validate_project、rollback_deployment这些操作。\n\n用户的需求是：复制车间一的页面到车间二，替换其中所有的'WS1'点位标签为'WS2'，然后做下装前校验。\n\n但是，在DEPLOY阶段，我没有manage_pages工具来执行复制页面和替换点位标签的操作。我只能进行部署相关的操作。\n\n根据行为准则第5条：若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，你可以在回复的纯文本中包含 \"next_state: 阶段名\" 来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段。\n\n可切换的下一阶段包括：DONE, VALIDATE。我需要切换回VALIDATE阶段才能使用manage_pages等工具来完成页面复制和替换操作。\n\n所以，我需要先切换回VALIDATE阶段来完成页面操作，然后再回到DEPLOY阶段进行校验和部署。\n\n不过，用户明确要求\"做下装前校验\"，这可以通过validate_project来完成。但复制页面和替换点位标签的操作需要在其他阶段完成。\n\n让我先检查当前的部署状态，然后决定下一步。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1804, "output_tokens": 333, "latency_ms": 10449.217000001227, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "当前处于DEPLOY阶段，可用工具只有deployment。用户的需求是：1. 复制车间一页面到车间二 2. 替换所有'WS1'点位标签为'WS2' 3. 做下装前校验。\n\n但是，在当前DEPLOY阶段，我无法执行页面复制和点位替换操作，因为这些操作需要manage_pages等工具，而这些工具在当前阶段不可用。根据行为准则第5条，如果当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，我可以在回复的纯文本中包含 \"next_state: 阶段名\" 来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段。\n\n可切换的下一阶段包括：DONE, VALIDATE。我需要切换到VALIDATE阶段才能使用manage_pages等工具完成页面复制和替换操作。不过，用户要求\"做下装前校验\"，这可以通过deployment工具的validate_project操作来完成。\n\n但问题是我无法完成前两个步骤（复制页面和替换点位标签）。如果直接进行校验，校验可能会失败，因为页面可能还不存在。\n\n我需要向用户解释当前情况，并建议先切换到VALIDATE阶段完成页面操作，然后再回到DEPLOY阶段进行校验。或者，我可以直接执行校验操作，但先说明我无法完成前两个步骤。\n\n让我先尝试执行validate_project，看看校验结果如何。如果校验失败，我可以建议用户先完成页面复制和替换操作。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2203, "output_tokens": 747, "latency_ms": 21423.811299999215, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我已经完成了您要求的第三步：下装前校验。\n\n**校验结果：** ✅ 项目校验通过，没有发现错误。项目状态为\"草稿\"，可以进行下装。\n\n**关于页面复制和点位替换：** \n当前处于DEPLOY阶段，可用工具仅支持部署相关操作（校验、部署、回滚、状态查询），**不支持页面复制和点位标签替换**。这些操作需要在更早的阶段（如VALIDATE阶段）使用`manage_pages`等工具完成，但根据当前工作流，`manage_pages`工具仅允许`list_pages`查询操作，不允许创建、复制或修改页面。\n\n**建议方案：**\n1. 如果您已经手动完成了\"车间一\"页面的复制到\"车间二\"，并将'WS1'替换为'WS2'，那么现在可以直接进行下装。\n2. 如果您尚未完成页面复制和替换，需要先在其他系统或界面中完成这些配置，然后重新运行校验。\n\n**下一步选择：**\n- 如果您确认页面配置已完成，我可以执行下装操作。\n- 如果您需要重新校验，我可以再次运行校验。\n- 如果您想查看当前部署状态，我可以显示详细状态。\n\n请告诉我您希望如何进行。", "reasoning": "用户要求：1. 复制车间一的页面到车间二；2. 替换其中所有的'WS1'点位标签为'WS2'；3. 然后做下装前校验。\n\n当前处于DEPLOY阶段，可用工具只有deployment，包括：deploy_project, show_deployment_status, validate_project, rollback_deployment。\n\n我已经执行了validate_project，结果显示校验通过，没有错误。但用户要求的是先复制页面和替换点位标签，然后做校验。然而在DEPLOY阶段，我没有manage_pages工具来执行复制和替换操作。根据行为准则，若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，我可以在回复的纯文本中包含 \"next_state: 阶段名\" 来切换到可切换的下一阶段。\n\n可切换的下一阶段包括：DONE, VALIDATE。VALIDATE阶段可能有manage_pages工具？让我检查一下之前VALIDATE阶段是否有可用的工具。在之前的VALIDATE阶段，可用工具包括manage_pages（仅允许list_pages操作）、deployment（允许show_deployment_status和validate_project）、manage_history、manage_points、manage_scripts。所以即使切换到VALIDATE阶段，manage_pages也只允许list_pages，不允许复制或替换操作。\n\n看来当前的工作流和工具限制无法直接完成用户要求的复制和替换操作。我需要告知用户这一限制，并说明已经完成了下装前校验（validate_project通过）。用户可能需要先手动完成页面复制和替换，然后再进行校验。\n\n但根据用户指令，他们期望我作为助手完成这些操作。然而工具限制使我无法完成复制和替换。我应该诚实地说明情况，并询问用户是否希望我继续进行部署（因为校验已通过），或者他们需要先手动完成页面操作。\n\n另外，根据高危操作安全准则，我不能跳过校验强制下装。但这里校验已经通过，所以如果用户要求部署，我可以执行deploy_project。不过用户没有明确要求部署，只要求校验。\n\n我应该先总结当前状态：校验已通过，但复制和替换操作无法在当前阶段执行。然后询问用户下一步操作。或者，我可以建议用户先手动完成页面复制和替换，然后再次进行校验。\n\n让我用文本回复用户。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "DeploymentCheck"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 7096, "output_tokens": 1593, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 54955.355599999166}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "5fba41eb-a85e-461c-a4fc-c10d5b708a7b", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-030", "text": "给根本不存在的假点位配上一大堆高低报，然后再开个趋势图看它", "complexity": "complex", "domain": "multi"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T09:26:28.986Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T09:27:24.977Z", "total_turns": 3, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T09:26:28.986Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T09:26:46.243Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T09:26:46.243Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T09:27:24.977Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.3299999991431832, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history", "enable_history", "set_retention"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_history", "action": "list_history", "args": {"action": "list_history"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "histories": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.3374999980442226, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 978, "output_tokens": 407, "latency_ms": 17252.033900000242, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想要给一个不存在的假点位配置高低报警，然后开个趋势图查看。这听起来有点问题——我得先确认当前有哪些点位和历史配置。目前处于ANALYZE_INTENT阶段，可用工具有manage_history和manage_points。用户说要给\"假点位\"配置报警，但首先得检查是否存在这样的点位。如果不存在，可能需要先创建点位。不过用户提到的是\"假点位\"，这可能意味着点位是虚构的，或者用户想要创建一个示例点位用于测试。另外，配置报警需要CONFIG_ALARM阶段，而查看趋势图可能涉及历史数据或图表功能。\n\n根据工作流上下文，当前workflow是HistoryQuery，step是check_history_config。用户的需求涉及报警配置和趋势图，这超出了当前阶段。根据行为准则第5条，如果当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，我可以在回复的纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换到合适的阶段。\n\n不过，首先还是应该先获取现有信息。我应该调用manage_points来列出所有点位，看看是否有用户提到的\"假点位\"。如果不存在，可能需要创建。但创建点位需要CONFIG_POINT阶段，而当前阶段没有创建工具。因此，我需要先切换阶段。\n\n另外，配置报警需要CONFIG_ALARM阶段，查看趋势图可能涉及历史数据，这需要CONFIG_HISTORY阶段。所以，可能需要按顺序切换到这些阶段。\n\n但用户的要求是\"给根本不存在的假点位配上一大堆高低报，然后再开个趋势图看它\"。这听起来像是一个测试场景：创建一个假点位，配置报警，然后查看趋势。我需要先确认当前系统中是否有这样的点位。\n\n那么，我先调用manage_points来列出点位。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1792, "output_tokens": 313, "latency_ms": 10267.32720000291, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "当前处于CONFIG_HISTORY阶段，可用工具有manage_history和manage_points。用户想要给一个不存在的假点位配置高低报警，然后开趋势图查看。\n\n首先，我需要理解用户的需求：他们想要一个\"假点位\"（可能是一个测试或示例点位），然后为它配置多个高低报警，最后通过趋势图查看数据。\n\n但这里有几个问题：\n1. 当前系统中没有任何点位（count: 0）。\n2. 配置报警（高低报）属于CONFIG_ALARM阶段的任务，不是当前阶段。\n3. 开趋势图查看历史数据，这需要历史数据配置，属于CONFIG_HISTORY阶段，但需要先有点位和历史配置。\n\n根据行为准则，如果当前阶段的工具不满足需求，我可以在回复中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换到合适的阶段。\n\n用户的需求涉及：\n- 创建点位：需要CONFIG_POINT阶段\n- 配置报警：需要CONFIG_ALARM阶段  \n- 配置历史数据：需要CONFIG_HISTORY阶段（当前阶段）\n- 查看趋势图：可能涉及图表配置\n\n所以，我需要先告诉用户当前系统中没有点位，需要先创建点位。然后建议切换到CONFIG_POINT阶段。\n\n让我先检查一下当前阶段的历史配置情况。使用manage_history的list_history功能，看看是否有任何历史配置。这可能会提供一些信息。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1764, "output_tokens": 876, "latency_ms": 28456.566900000325, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "根据当前系统状态，我发现了以下情况：\n\n1. **点位配置为空**：系统中没有任何已配置的点位（tag count: 0）\n2. **历史记录配置为空**：没有配置任何历史记录采集（histories count: 0）\n\n要完成您\"给假点位配高低报，再开趋势图查看\"的需求，需要按以下顺序进行：\n\n1. **创建假点位** → 需要进入 `CONFIG_POINT` 阶段\n2. **配置高低报警** → 需要进入 `CONFIG_ALARM` 阶段  \n3. **配置历史数据采集** → 当前 `CONFIG_HISTORY` 阶段\n4. **配置趋势图** → 可能需要额外的图表配置阶段\n\n由于当前 `CONFIG_HISTORY` 阶段的工具无法创建点位或配置报警，我需要先切换到 `CONFIG_POINT` 阶段来创建您需要的假点位。\n\nnext_state: CONFIG_POINT\n\n切换到点位配置阶段后，您可以告诉我：\n- 假点位的名称（例如：FAKE_TAG_001）\n- 数据类型（模拟量、数字量等）\n- 其他基本参数\n\n之后我们再依次配置报警和历史记录。", "reasoning": "用户想要给一个不存在的假点位配置高低报警，然后开趋势图查看。当前处于CONFIG_HISTORY阶段，可用工具有manage_history和manage_points。刚才的查询显示没有点位，也没有历史配置。\n\n用户的需求涉及多个阶段：首先需要创建点位（CONFIG_POINT），然后配置报警（CONFIG_ALARM），再配置历史数据（CONFIG_HISTORY），最后可能需要图表展示。但当前阶段是CONFIG_HISTORY，我只能使用manage_history工具。\n\n不过，我可以先配置历史数据，但需要指定一个点位名。用户提到\"假点位\"，我可以假设一个点位名，比如\"FAKE_TAG_001\"，然后为其配置历史记录。但这样可能没有实际意义，因为点位并不存在。不过，也许用户只是想演示流程。\n\n另外，用户提到\"高低报\"，这是报警配置，属于CONFIG_ALARM阶段。而\"趋势图\"可能涉及图表配置，但当前没有图表配置工具。\n\n根据行为准则，如果当前阶段工具不满足需求，我可以在回复中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换阶段。但用户可能期望我先处理当前阶段能做的事情。\n\n我应该先告知用户当前情况：系统中没有点位，也没有历史配置。要完成用户需求，需要先创建点位（CONFIG_POINT阶段），然后配置报警（CONFIG_ALARM阶段），再配置历史数据（CONFIG_HISTORY阶段），最后配置图表（可能需要另一个阶段）。\n\n我可以尝试在当前阶段配置一个假点位的历史记录，但需要点位名。让我假设一个点位名，比如\"SIMULATED_TEMP\"，然后配置历史记录。不过，这可能需要先有点位定义。\n\n实际上，manage_history工具可能允许为任意标签名配置历史记录，即使该标签未在点位管理中定义。让我尝试使用query_history功能，但需要指定一个标签名。\n\n首先，让我检查是否有其他点位或历史配置。使用list_points和list_history已经显示为空。所以，我需要建议用户先创建点位。\n\n我会回复用户，说明当前情况，并建议切换到CONFIG_POINT阶段创建点位。然后依次进行报警配置和历史配置。\n\n我会在回复中包含\"next_state: CONFIG_POINT\"。但根据行为准则，我需要在纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"。所以，我会在回复中说明并包含这个指令。\n\n另外，用户提到\"假点位\"，可能意味着他们想要一个模拟点位。也许可以在不创建真实点位的情况下配置历史数据？但为了完整性，建议还是先创建点位。\n\n我决定这样回复：首先说明当前没有点位和历史配置，要完成用户需求需要多个阶段。然后建议切换到CONFIG_POINT阶段创建假点位。我会在回复中包含\"next_state: CONFIG_POINT\"。这样用户就可以继续了。\n\n现在生成回复。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n