tools. I don't have any alarm management tools available yet. So even if the point existed, I couldn't create the alarm in this stage.\n\nLet me inform the user about both issues:\n1. The point doesn't exist\n2. I need to proceed to the proper stage to configure alarms (CONFIG_ALARM)"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 3036, "output_tokens": 677, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 20903.291399998125}, "judge": null}
